{"sample_id": "Android_Android_140_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, dark purple color palette...\n\nThe screen features a title and subtitle at the top. Below, there are three rounded rectangle buttons, each with a circular icon on the left and descriptive text on the right. The icons include a phone with a car and two car icons. At the bottom, there is a primary CTA button with rounded corners."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, clean and modern with a purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title at the top, followed by three circular icons containing car illustrations, each paired with a title and descriptive body text. Below this is a partial view of a car image. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is at the bottom, containing the text \"Skip >\". The layout uses ample whitespace for clarity."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, dark mode with a purple accent color.\n\nA full-screen layout features a prominent title at the top. Below, three card components are stacked vertically, each containing a circular icon placeholder with a purple fill, a title, and supporting body text. A primary CTA button with rounded corners and purple fill is at the bottom. A \"Skip\" button is present."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, muted gray and white color palette with a vibrant purple accent.\n\nThe screen features a full-width hero image at the top with a prominent title. Below, a secondary title acts as a subheading. Three circular card components are arranged horizontally, each containing a car icon and descriptive text underneath. A purple Floating Action Button (FAB) is positioned at the bottom center of the screen. Ample whitespace provides visual breathing room."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, dark purple color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title at the top. Below the title are three rounded rectangle buttons in a vertical list. Each button contains a circular icon on the left with a car glyph and a text label on the right. At the bottom of the screen is a \"Skip\" button."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, clean and modern with a purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a \"Skip\" link at the top left. Below, a series of three list items, each with a circular icon containing a car-related glyph and descriptive text to the right. The text appears to explain the app's features. At the bottom, a circular FAB with an 'x' icon is present. The background is a solid purple color."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding theme, purple and white color palette. The screen features a title and subtitle at the top. Below is a card with a circular icon containing a car graphic, alongside a title and supporting text. A \"Skip\" button is placed below. Two additional cards follow, each with a circular icon and corresponding title and descriptive text. Finally, a primary CTA button spans the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, dark purple color palette...\n\nThe screen features a two-tone background. The top section contains a prominent title. Below this, a list of three cards is displayed, each with a circular icon containing a car illustration and descriptive text to the right. At the bottom of the screen, there is a circular button with the text \"SKIP\"."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, dark purple and violet color palette. The screen features a title text at the top, followed by a subtitle. Below are three rounded button components with a car icon on the left, a title, and a description. A circular FAB is at the bottom center."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, dark purple color palette...\n\nThe screen features a title at the top with a progress bar below. Three circular icons with car-related symbols are vertically aligned on the left. To the right of each icon is a short description. At the bottom is a \"Skip\" button."}]}
{"sample_id": "24090_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a monochromatic color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a grid layout of circular avatar images, each with a text label underneath indicating a name. Above the grid is a block of descriptive text. A bottom navigation bar contains several icons for primary actions. The main logo is centered at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of circular artist avatars. Each avatar is accompanied by a text label indicating the artist's name. A title bar at the top reads \"Tap on arttiss like\" with a back button on the left. A bottom navigation bar contains three icons for navigation. The artist avatars are arranged in a 3xN grid, with placeholder images representing various musical artists."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and a save icon. Below, there's a title and subtitle. A grid of circular avatar images is displayed, each with a text label underneath, presumably representing artist names. A bottom navigation bar with icons for home and settings is present. The avatars are arranged in a 3x4 grid layout. The screen's purpose is likely to allow the user to select artists."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, monochromatic color palette with red accents.\n\nThe screen displays a selection interface with a title and descriptive text at the top. Below, a grid of circular avatar images, each labeled with a text description. At the bottom, there is a bottom navigation bar with standard navigation icons. A red-filled \"CANCEL\" button is on the left, and a \"DONE\" button is on the right."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, grayscale color palette with subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a grid layout of circular avatar images, each representing an artist. Below each avatar is a text label with the artist's name. Above the grid is a title and subtitle text block. A bottom navigation bar contains several icon buttons for primary navigation. \"Cancel\" and \"Done\" buttons are positioned at the bottom corners of the screen."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle use of shadows for depth.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of circular image cards, each containing a portrait of a musician. Below each image is a text label displaying the musician's name. At the top is a back arrow and a title. At the bottom of the screen are four circular buttons: a like button, a cancel button, a done button, and a forward button."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen displays a selection of artist avatars in a grid layout. Each circular avatar is accompanied by a text label underneath. Above the grid is a title and subtitle text block. Below the grid are three buttons: a \"Cancel\" button, a circular play icon button, and a primary \"Done\" button. A pagination indicator is centered at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a grid layout of circular avatar images, each representing an artist. Below each avatar is a text label displaying the artist's name. Above the grid is a back button and a title. Below the title is a descriptive text block. At the bottom of the screen is a bottom navigation bar with five icon buttons."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and minimal design elements.\n\nThe screen features a grid layout of circular avatar images, each representing a user or profile. Below each avatar is a text label displaying the user's name. A title is present at the top of the screen. A bottom navigation bar contains several icons for different actions. A floating action button is positioned on the bottom right."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen presents a grid of circular avatar images, each representing a different user or artist. Above the grid is a text prompt. Below the grid are three ghost button options: \"Cancel,\" \"Daniel,\" and \"Done.\" A close icon is positioned on the right side. A bottom navigation bar contains three icons for navigation."}]}
{"sample_id": "56935_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, red and gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title. Below is a title and two card previews. The first card has a logo and text, the second is a grayed-out card with a logo. Below the cards is a text description. A red primary CTA button labeled \"ADD CARD\" is placed above a white space. A red circular FAB with a down arrow is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, with a clean white background and accent primary color of red.\n\nThe layout features a title bar with app title and icons on the right. Below is a subtitle text element. Two gray card components are stacked vertically, each containing a placeholder image and descriptive text. A red card component fills the lower portion of the screen. A circular FAB with a plus icon is positioned in the bottom right corner. Each card has rounded corners."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Neumorphism style, red and gray color palette. The screen displays a card management interface with a top app bar containing a title and menu icon. Below, descriptive text introduces the card section. Two card previews are displayed as cards with rounded corners. A larger text element is placed below the cards. A modal appears at the bottom, featuring a title, list items with checkboxes and icons, and a bottom-aligned FAB. The top right corner contains a notification badge."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, red and gray color palette. The screen features a top app bar with a back button and title. Below is a section titled \"MY CCARD\" displaying two stacked card mockups with rounded corners. The front card is dark gray with a logo and text, while the back card is light gray with a chip and other details. An \"ADD CARD\" section follows, with descriptive text. A red button with the text \"BAB\" and a number next to it are present. A red FAB is positioned at the bottom right."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, red and gray color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a title bar with the app name. Below is a heading and subheading. Two card components are arranged horizontally; the left card contains an avatar, user name, and a numerical value, along with a primary CTA. The right card has a logo and a primary CTA. Below the cards are two radio buttons and a text label. At the bottom right is a circular FAB."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, red and gray color palette. The screen displays a card management interface.\n\nAt the top is a title bar with the app name and settings icons. Below, a \"My Cards\" section displays two card previews. A text element prompts the user to add their first card. An \"Add Card\" section with descriptive text and a plus icon follows. Further down, there's a section displaying \"E4 cards\" and a card detail section with a numerical value and card information. A red FAB with a plus icon is at the bottom right."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist style, red and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and back button. Below is a red banner with a \"My Cards\" title. A card component with rounded corners and placeholder text is present. A section with a title and body text prompts the user to add their first card, accompanied by a red FAB. A list item with a title and subtitle is displayed, followed by a red button with text. A bottom navigation bar is visible at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bold and modern theme, red and gray color palette. The screen features a top app bar with a title and an icon. Below, a subtitle and a pill-shaped button. Two card components with rounded corners display placeholder graphics. A title and subtitle are positioned below the cards. A circular FAB is on the right side. A bottom bar contains two buttons, one on each side."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, warm coral and gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title bar with a prominent title and action icons on the right. Below, two card components are arranged horizontally, each containing a placeholder card image and descriptive text. A primary CTA button labeled \"ADD CARD\" is centrally located. Below the button is placeholder text. A circular FAB is anchored to the bottom right corner."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, red and gray color palette. The screen features a top red header with the \"Stocard\" logo and a user icon. Below, a secondary red bar displays a phone number and an \"ADD CARD\" button. Two card components are horizontally arranged, each with a logo and card name. Below the cards, there is a text block and a hashtag. The background is a solid gray."}]}
{"sample_id": "Android_Android_2_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a cool blue accent color.\n\nThe screen features a logo at the top, followed by two rounded-corner buttons for \"Sign in with Facebook\" and \"Login in Google\", each with a Facebook or Google icon. A primary CTA button labeled \"Sign up\" is below. Two input fields with labels \"ST MAOW\" and \"Lodgine password\" are present, followed by a radio button with the label \"ASU password\". Finally, there are two more rounded-corner buttons at the bottom. All text is white."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark color palette with gold accents. The screen displays a login/signup interface.\n\nThe layout includes a back arrow icon at the top left, followed by a logo and app name. Below is a \"Sign in with Google\" text label. Two input fields with labels \"Email Faceebok\" and \"Passgn password?\" are present, each with a horizontal divider line. A \"Log in\" text label is centered. Two stacked buttons labeled \"Sign up\" with different background colors (white and gold) are displayed. A logo is present, followed by a final button labeled \"Lroul Nore\". The background is blurred."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, cool color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with a logo at the top. Below is a title and two primary CTA buttons for \"Facebook\" and \"Log in\". Further down are input fields labeled \"Emgi up\" and \"Passsword\", followed by a \"FoCL WU rp\" section with \"Clenrom\" and \"Pag'rworo\" options. A final \"Log In\" button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a blue accent color.\n\nThe screen displays a modal login screen with the company logo at the top. Below the logo is a \"Sign in with Google?\" prompt. A text field is present for username and password entry, followed by a primary CTA button labeled \"Log in\" in a blue fill. Below that is a secondary button labeled \"Sign\". A faint line separates the main content from a \"Sign in up\" link. The background is blurred."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, dark blue and teal color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with a logo at the top. Below the logo are social login buttons. A title reads \"Sign in with password?\". Two input fields with labels \"Email in\" and \"Login\" are stacked vertically. A primary CTA button with the text \"Sign up\" is at the bottom. The background features a blurred image."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark color palette with white accents...\n\nThe screen displays a sign-in/sign-up form. At the top, there is a prominent white button with a blue icon and the text \"Sign in us with Google.\" Below, a \"Sign up\" section with input fields labeled \"Email in toe with F password?\" and \"Signword\" with corresponding icons. There are also buttons for signing in with Facebook and Google. Finally, a white button labeled \"Ganc Eid un\" is at the bottom. The background is a blurred image."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a blue accent color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a login/sign-up interface. At the top is a logo. Below the logo is a rounded-corner button for \"Sign in with Google.\" Below that are text fields for email and password. Below the password field is a \"Sign up\" button, followed by a \"Sign in\" button. At the bottom is a checkbox with associated text and a primary CTA button. The background features a blurred image."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a login/sign-up interface, starting with a logo at the top. Below the logo are two rounded text input fields with placeholder text. Underneath the input fields is a \"Sign up\" button. Below that is a line of placeholder text. A primary CTA button is placed below that. Finally, a secondary \"Sign in\" button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, cool color palette with blues and whites, and a blurred background image.\n\nThe screen displays a login/signup interface. At the top is a logo and the brand name. Below, there are options to \"Sign in\" with Facebook, password, or Google. There are three input fields with labels: \"Facebook?\", \"Password,\" and \"Login in,\" styled with a frosted glass effect. Below the input fields are two primary CTAs: a white \"Sign in\" button and a blue \"Sign up\" button. The background is a blurred image."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, dark color palette with teal and blue accents...\n\nThe screen displays a sign-up/login interface. At the top is the company logo. Below is a \"Sign up\" title. There are two input fields for email and password. A \"Log in\" button with a teal fill is placed below the input fields. A \"Sign in with Google\" button is placed to the right of the email input field. Additional options for sign-up are present, followed by a primary CTA button at the bottom. The background is blurred."}]}
{"sample_id": "iphone_IMG_899828_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, natural green and white color palette. The screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape with a van in the foreground.\n\nA logo is placed at the top center, followed by a prominent title and a tagline. Below the image of the van, there is a \"Sign up\" text link. At the bottom, a primary CTA button with rounded corners is present, containing the text \"Log in\". The text elements are white, providing contrast against the background."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, muted color palette with dark overlay.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a van in a mountain landscape. A prominent title and subtitle are centered over the image. At the bottom, a full-width primary CTA button with rounded corners is present. The button contains a call-to-action text label."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, teal and white color palette. The screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape with a van.\n\nThe app logo is centered at the top, with a tagline below. A \"Log in\" primary CTA button is placed at the bottom, with a \"Sign up\" secondary button below it, both with rounded corners. An arrow icon is in the top left corner and a circular icon is in the top right corner."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, natural green and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape with a car in the foreground. A prominent white logo and a tagline are centered at the top. Below, a primary CTA button with rounded corners and a green fill prompts the user to sign up. At the bottom, a secondary button with rounded corners and a green fill is present."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, with a dark green and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a van in a mountainous landscape. The app logo is centered at the top, with a tagline beneath it. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is positioned at the bottom. A back arrow icon is in the top left corner."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, natural color palette with greens and blues.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape. A circular refresh icon is in the top left corner. The app logo and tagline are centered over the hero image. A prominent, rectangular primary CTA button with rounded corners is at the bottom center, with the text \"Log in\"."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, natural color palette...\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape with a camper van. A prominent title and subtitle are overlaid in white text. A rounded primary CTA button with white text is positioned at the bottom center."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, muted gray and white color palette with a nature-inspired hero image.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image of a mountain landscape with a van in the foreground. A prominent title and subtitle are centered over the image. Below the image is a logo and additional descriptive text. At the bottom, a primary CTA button spans the width of the screen. An arrow icon is positioned in the top left corner."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, muted color palette with a full-screen hero image.\n\nThe layout features a full-screen background image of a mountain landscape with a van. A prominent title and tagline are centered near the top. Below the hero section is a block of unreadable text. A primary CTA button, \"Log in,\" is anchored to the bottom of the screen. The logo is placed above the title."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, adventure theme, muted color palette with greens and grays...\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape with a camper van. A back arrow icon is positioned in the top left corner. Centered text elements include a prominent title and a subtitle below it. A rounded primary CTA button with white text is anchored at the bottom."}]}
{"sample_id": "16952_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, vibrant purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list view with circular icons of varying colors on the left. Each list item contains a title and a subtitle. A prominent title \"Why you feeling this way?\" is at the top. The top right has a profile icon. A search icon is on the right side. A \"Next Vay\" primary CTA button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, vibrant purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a health log with a back button and \"Next\" button in the top corners. Below the title, there's a question prompt. A list of selectable options follows, each with a leading icon and descriptive text labels. An \"Other\" section is present, followed by more selectable options. At the bottom, there's a circular FAB with an icon and some text labels."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list of options. At the top is a title and subtitle. Below are list items with a circular icon on the left and text on the right. Each list item has a different icon on the right side. At the bottom is a rounded rectangle with text. There is a back button on the top left and a user icon on the top right."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, vibrant purple color palette...\n\nThe screen features a list of selectable options. At the top is a title text element. Each option has a circular icon to the left and a text label. Some options have a chevron icon on the right, indicating a dropdown or further options. A \"Next\" button is in the upper right corner. At the bottom is a full-width primary CTA button labeled \"Other.\" A small avatar icon is in the top left. Horizontal dividers separate some list items."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, purple and pink color palette. The screen features a title at the top. Below is a list of selectable options with icons and text labels, each followed by a radio button. Further down are rounded button components with text. At the bottom is a bottom navigation bar."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, purple and pink color palette with yellow accents.\n\nThe screen presents a list of questions. At the top is an icon button, a title, and a segmented control with three options. Below is a title question. The list items consist of a circular icon on the left, a title, and a circular icon button on the right. At the bottom is a primary CTA button."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, purple and pink color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a question at the top, followed by a list of options. Each option has a colored circle on the left and a radio button on the right. The options consist of a title and some have a subtitle. At the bottom is a primary CTA button with rounded corners."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, vibrant purple background...\n\nThe screen displays a \"Health Log\" interface with a back button at the top left. Below the title is a block of placeholder text. Two horizontal rows of circular icons with labels are present. A \"NEXT\" label introduces a vertical list of items, each with a circular icon and a label on the left, and corresponding labels or icons on the right. A slider and additional text elements are included, and a rounded button with the text \"LIORT\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette on a dark purple background.\n\nThe screen features a title \"Health Log\" at the top left and a \"Next\" button at the top right. Below is a question prompt. A vertical list of circular icons with associated labels and descriptions follows. Each list item has a colored circle on the left and a small icon on the right. A bottom navigation bar contains four icons for navigation."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list of options. At the top is a title, followed by a back button in the upper right corner. Below the title is a vertical list of circular icons with text labels to the right. Each list item consists of a colored circle containing an icon, and a text label describing the option. The list extends down the screen."}]}
{"sample_id": "33576_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel app theme, cool blue and white color palette with green accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list of hotel properties. At the top is a header with a menu icon, a title \"14 Properties,\" and a map icon. Below the header is a filter/sort bar. The main content area contains a scrollable list of hotel cards, each with a hero image, hotel name, brief description, star ratings, and price information. A primary CTA button is at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, with a predominantly white and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list of property cards with rounded corners, each featuring a hero image at the top. Below each image is a title, star rating, and price. A green \"Value Deal\" banner overlays one of the cards. At the top is a header with a title and action icons. A bottom navigation bar contains three primary CTAs with rounded styling. The list view presents property options with placeholder images and descriptive text."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, blue and white color palette with green accents, modern and clean aesthetic.\n\nThe screen displays a list of property cards in a vertical scroll view. Each card contains a hero image, a title, a star rating, and a price. A green \"Book Now Deal!\" banner is placed on the top left corner. Each card also features a primary CTA button. The top app bar contains a back button on the left and a profile icon on the right, with a title in the center. The cards are neatly arranged with consistent padding and whitespace. Some cards contain additional details such as location and smaller icons representing amenities."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, with a blue and white color palette, and green accent color.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title text. Below is a hero image of a resort with a green banner overlay containing prominent title text. A \"Sort\" button and \"Map\" link are positioned above a horizontal list of card components. Each card displays a hotel image, title, price, rating stars, and a primary CTA button. A bottom navigation bar with icons and labels is present for main navigation."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list of properties. At the top, there's a title and subtitle, followed by two rounded-corner buttons. Below, a list of card components displays property images, titles, star ratings, and prices. Each card has a rounded image on the left and property details on the right. A bottom navigation bar is present with icons. The screen uses a clean layout with ample whitespace."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with a back arrow and user profile. Below is a search bar and a horizontal list of filter options. The main content area displays a vertical list of card components, each featuring a split-screen image of a resort, a value deal badge, hotel name, and a numerical price tag. A row of pagination dots sits below the cards. A bottom navigation bar with icons for messages, call, and booking completes the layout."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a cool color palette of blues and greens, and a modern, clean aesthetic.\n\nThe layout features a full-width hero image at the top with overlaid text promoting a \"Value Deal.\" Below, a card component displays property listings with a smaller image, title, star ratings, and pricing information. A horizontal scrollable list of location filters is present. At the bottom, a full-width primary CTA button is visible. The top app bar contains a back button, title text, and a profile icon."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean travel app theme, bright blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of travel cards. Each card contains a placeholder image, a title, a price, and rating information. Some cards have a green \"Value Deal\" banner. The top navigation bar contains a back button, a title, and action icons. A bottom navigation bar is present with icons. Cards are arranged in a two-column grid layout with consistent padding. Text elements are used for titles, descriptions, and price tags."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with blue accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of property listings. Each listing is presented in a card format, containing a rounded-corner image placeholder, a title, a subtitle, and a numerical price tag. Some cards include a star rating and a pill-shaped button. A primary CTA button is present on some cards. A bottom navigation bar with three icons is visible at the bottom of the screen. The top of the screen displays a title."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light blue and white color palette with blue accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list of properties. At the top, there's a back button and a title. Below is a card with a property image, a green promotional banner, and a red call button. Property details include a title and address. There are filter and sort buttons. A list of property cards follows, each displaying a price, address, and a button. Each card also contains a star rating and a small numerical value. A floating action button is on the left side of the screen."}]}
{"sample_id": "5331_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen features a grid layout of rounded cards, each containing a relevant image at the top. Below each image is a title and a subtitle in a smaller font size. Each card has two circular icons at the bottom, presumably for interaction. A teal banner with a title spans the top of the grid. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light color palette with a red accent.\n\nThe screen displays a grid layout of cards, each featuring a food-related image at the top. Below each image is a title, star ratings, and additional supporting text. A top app bar contains a back button and a title. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present for primary navigation. The main content area displays a question prompt."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays a selection interface with a title at the top. Below, a segmented control with two options. A grid layout of cards follows, each containing a lifestyle image, a title, a subtitle, and a circular button at the bottom to select or deselect. The bottom navigation bar is visible with standard navigation icons."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and bright theme, with a teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of square cards, each containing an image and a text label below. The images are placeholders representing various categories. A title is at the top, with a back arrow on the left and a checkmark icon on the right. Below the grid is a bottom navigation bar with four icons and a rounded rectangle button with text. The icons are filled with teal, and one is outlined."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with a teal accent.\n\nThe screen presents a grid of rounded-corner card components, each containing a lifestyle image and a title with a dropdown icon. Above the grid is a prominent title text. Below the grid is a full-width primary CTA button with rounded corners, and a close button. The card images appear to represent various lifestyle categories. The card titles are short labels."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays a grid-based layout of category cards with rounded corners and subtle drop shadows. Each card contains a representative image, a title, and additional metadata. A prominent title bar asks \"What sare your interested in?\". Below, a \"Cateegory\" label is present. The grid displays nine cards with images related to food, beauty, home decor, and lifestyle. Each card includes a title and subtitle, with some cards also featuring small icons and numerical values. A bottom navigation bar with three icons is visible."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light color palette with a focus on whitespace.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of rounded-rectangle cards, each containing an image placeholder and a text label below. The images represent various categories like food, beauty, and DIY. Each card has a small checkmark icon indicating selection. A prominent title bar at the top displays the question \"What are you intersed in?\". At the bottom, there are two buttons: a secondary button with a left-aligned text label and a primary CTA button with a right-aligned text label."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top section with a blurred background image and a prominent title. Below, a grid layout displays category cards, each with a representative image, title, and descriptive text. A \"Selectup\" label precedes another row of similar cards. A primary CTA button spans the bottom, and a close icon is positioned at the top right. A profile icon is placed on the top right. A menu icon is on the left."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light color palette with teal accent...\n\nThe screen displays a grid of rounded-corner cards, each containing a lifestyle image. Below each image is a title and subtitle text element. A prominent title is at the top of the screen. At the bottom is a full-width primary CTA button with rounded corners and a text label. A back button is in the top left corner."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light color palette with subtle green accents.\n\nThe screen presents a selection interface with a title \"What are you interested in?\" and subtitle \"Pick 2, or more\". Below, a grid of square image cards displays various topics like \"Hair sstyles\", \"Humor\", \"Recipes\", \"DIY home decor\", and \"Makeup\". Each card contains a representative image and a text label underneath. A primary CTA with a checkmark icon is positioned at the top right. An info icon is placed next to the text \"Foood (or beauty)\"."}]}
