A pink-colored bottom navigation bar contains five icon buttons for primary navigation. A rectangular button with text is placed above the bottom navigation."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, bright pink and white color palette. The screen displays a grid-based layout of wedding-themed images. Each image is accompanied by a title and a decorative wave element. A prominent title \"Virtual Planner\" is at the top left, with a \"To-do\" button on the right. A large pink rounded button with text is present. A bottom navigation bar with icons and labels provides access to different sections. A floating action button (FAB) labeled \"TOP\" is on the lower right."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and playful theme, pink and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and menu icons. Below, a two-column grid displays card components, each containing a placeholder image, a title, and descriptive text. A pink FAB is positioned on the right side of the screen. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present at the bottom. The cards appear to represent different categories or tasks within a planner application."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with pink accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and the title \"Virtual Planner.\" Below, a grid of image cards showcases wedding-related photography. Each card contains a placeholder image and a text label underneath. A section with the title \"To-do. Cooodrdinanat or\" precedes another grid of image cards with labels such as \"Emgagement,\" \"Vendor,\" and \"Organiizer.\" A bottom bar with icons and text \"PRS1-2818\" is visible."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, bright pink and white color palette, with a playful and modern aesthetic.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and an icon. Below, a section labeled \"To do\" precedes a grid layout of card components, each containing a lifestyle image, a title, and a subtitle. A \"Vendor\" section follows, with more cards in a similar layout. A \"Guest\" section is present, continuing the card-based grid. A bottom navigation bar with several icons is at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with ample whitespace.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of card components, each featuring a rounded-corner image placeholder depicting wedding-related photography. Below each image is a title and subtitle text element. The top app bar contains a back button, a title \"Virtual Planner,\" and search and menu icons on the right. A bottom navigation bar with icons and labels is present. A pink FAB is positioned on the bottom right."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and playful theme, with a pink and white color palette, and a modern, clean aesthetic.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and icon. Below, a horizontally scrolling list of card components displaying wedding-themed images. Each card includes a title, subtitle, and a small icon. A bottom navigation bar with several icons is present for primary navigation. A floating action button (FAB) is positioned on the lower right. The cards contain placeholder images and descriptive text labels."}]}
{"sample_id": "Android_Android_15_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a blue accent color.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of food category options. At the top is a title and subtitle prompting the user to personalize their feed. A hamburger menu icon and a close icon are positioned in the top corners. Below the title is a grid of nine square cards, each containing a food image and a text label indicating the food category. A primary CTA button labeled \"Done\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean style, white and yellow color palette. The screen displays a grid of food images with labels, a prominent title, and supporting text.\n\nThe layout features a title and subtitle at the top, followed by a grid of nine food images, each with a text label underneath. A full-width primary CTA button is placed below the grid. At the bottom, there's a dark rounded section with a floating action button (FAB) containing the word \"Done.\""}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant food theme, dark color palette with white accents...\n\nThe screen displays a \"Personalize your feed!\" onboarding flow. It features a title and supporting body text at the top. Below, a grid of nine food category cards with rounded corners and food photography. Each card has a title and subtitle text. A red FAB with a white \"X\" icon is anchored at the bottom center. A back navigation icon is in the top right corner."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, food-focused, bright and clean color palette.\n\nThe screen features a hero image at the top with a prominent title and supporting body text. Below, a grid layout displays nine circular images, each representing a different food category. Each image has a corresponding title beneath it. A bottom navigation bar is present with a central button."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark color palette with white text elements and vibrant food photography.\n\nThe screen presents a grid of nine cards, each displaying a food-related image and a text label underneath. The cards are arranged in a 3x3 layout. Above the grid is a prominent title and supporting body text. A small icon is positioned in the top right corner. At the bottom of the screen, there's a prominent circular button with an 'X' icon, likely a dismiss or close action."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, with a light color palette and ample whitespace.\n\nThe screen presents a grid layout of food images, each paired with a category label and a dropdown icon. Above the grid is a prominent title and a subtitle. Below the grid is a bottom navigation bar with three icons and a central circular primary CTA button. Each grid item contains a food image, a category title, and a dropdown arrow."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern and clean, with a light and dark color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a grid of food images, each with a title below. The top section features a title and subtitle. Below this is a 3x3 grid of square image cards. Each card contains a food image and a text label underneath. At the bottom, a primary circular CTA button with an 'X' icon is centered, flanked by two inactive radio buttons."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, muted gray and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and a title. Below is a subtitle prompting the user to add or customize. A grid layout displays nine food category cards, each containing a square image placeholder and a text label underneath. At the bottom, a prominent circular primary CTA button with an \"X\" icon is centered."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a minimalist aesthetic and a muted color palette.\n\nThe screen presents a grid of nine rounded-corner cards, each containing a food image and a text label underneath. The images represent different food categories. Above the grid is a prominent title and a descriptive text element. Below the grid is a circular primary CTA button with an 'X' icon. A small graphic element is placed in the top right corner. Page indicator dots are centered below the title."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a muted gray background and subtle drop shadows.\n\nThe screen presents a modal overlay for personalizing a feed. It features a title and supporting text at the top, followed by a grid of nine food images, each with a label underneath. An \"X\" icon is positioned in the upper right corner for dismissal. A primary CTA button labeled \"Done\" is at the bottom. Each food item is displayed within a card component."}]}
{"sample_id": "3719_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, grayscale color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a \"Sign Up\" form. At the top, there's a circular icon with an arrow, followed by a prominent \"Sign Up\" title and a subtitle. Below are input fields with labels such as \"Set Photo,\" \"Bistihaad),\" and \"Phone (Recommend),\" each with a horizontal line underneath. A \"SIGN UP\" button is placed below the input fields. A white card with rounded corners is at the bottom, containing additional input fields and a final button labeled \"Thct.\""}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, muted gray color palette...\n\nThe screen presents a sign-up form with a back button at the top left. Below, there's a \"Sign Photo\" title with a radio button. The form includes input fields for \"Fet Set Photto\", \"Last Name\", \"First name\", \"Bitday\", \"Set\", \"([Passswmed)\", \"Phone\", and \"Recomemend\". A prominent \"SIGN UP\" button is placed below the input fields. At the bottom, there's a \"Terms istakes and privaccys policy\" text and a line of body text."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean style, muted gray and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a sign-up form within a white card on a gray background. At the top, there is a circular avatar placeholder. Below, a \"Sign Up\" title precedes input fields for \"First Name,\" \"Last Name,\" \"Birthday,\" and \"Reconiorid,\" each with a faint underline. Small icons appear to the right of some fields. Below the input fields, there is a \"Terms and Recommended\" text link. Two \"Sign Up\" buttons are present: one with a white background and black text, and another with a blue background and white text."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, light color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a sign-up form with a back arrow at the top left and a \"SIGN UP\" title centered at the top. Below the title is a circular avatar placeholder. Underneath the avatar is the title \"SIGN PUTP\". The form includes input fields labeled \"First Name,\" \"Lastt Name,\" \"Email,\" and \"Pecommend,\" each with a corresponding text input line. A checkbox with the label \"(recomened)\" is present, followed by a text field labeled \"Toug to: serttay\". A primary CTA button labeled \"SIGN UP\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, muted gray color palette.\n\nThe layout features a sign-up form with rounded text input fields for \"First Name,\" \"Last Name,\" \"Email,\" \"Password\" with a radio button, and \"Phone.\" Each field has a text label inside. An avatar placeholder icon is at the top, with a \"Sign Up\" title below it. A primary CTA button labeled \"SIGN UP\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, muted gray color palette.\n\nThe screen presents a sign-up form with rounded text input fields for \"First Name,\" \"Last Name,\" and \"Email.\" Below, there are two side-by-side input fields labeled \"Phone\" and \"Birthday.\" Above the form fields, there is a circular avatar placeholder with a download icon and the text \"Sign Photo.\" Below the form, there is a text block and a primary CTA button labeled \"SIGN UP.\""}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, dark and light color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a \"Sign Up\" form with a back button on the top left. The form fields include \"First Name,\" \"Last Name,\" \"Email,\" and \"Plassname,\" each with a corresponding icon. Below these fields, there is a section to upload a \"Photo,\" followed by a \"Terms and Privacy Policy\" link. The form continues with additional fields labeled \"First Name\" and \"Frront Cesurent.\" A circular element is positioned to the right of these fields. A prominent \"Sign Up\" button is placed at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode, muted gray and blue accent...\n\nThe screen displays a \"Sign Up\" form with a circular avatar placeholder at the top. Below the title, there are input fields labeled \"First Name,\" \"Last Name,\" \"Email,\" \"Birthday,\" and \"Phone,\" each with a corresponding text input area. To the right of \"Last Name\" and \"Birthday,\" there are placeholder texts. A prominent, rounded primary CTA button labeled \"SIGN UP\" is at the bottom. Below the button, there is some body text."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, muted gray color palette with white accents, and a clean, minimalist aesthetic.\n\nThe screen presents a sign-up form with a top close icon and a circular placeholder for a profile photo. Below is a title \"Sign Photo\". The form consists of multiple rows of rounded text input fields with labels such as \"First Name\", \"Photo\", \"Last UP Name\", \"Email\", \"Passesword\", and \"Phone\". Each input field contains placeholder text. A prominent \"SIGN UP\" primary CTA button is at the bottom, followed by a line of body text."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light gray and blue color palette. A \"Sign Up\" screen with a geometric logo at the top. Below, a large circular container holds input fields with labels such as \"First Photo,\" \"Email,\" and \"Password,\" each with a corresponding text input area. Radio buttons are present next to some fields. A primary blue \"Sign Up\" CTA button is at the bottom, with smaller \"Terms\" text above it."}]}
{"sample_id": "4140_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode, muted gray and green accents...\n\nThe screen displays a details page with a list of reviews. At the top is a price and a title. Below, a search icon and a hamburger menu. The review list contains user avatars, names, star ratings, and snippets of review text. A section with a title and a numerical rating is followed by a list of items with icons and titles. A primary CTA button is at the bottom right."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with green accents...\n\nThe screen displays a 'Details' view with a back arrow at the top left. Below the title are two labels, \"$17\" and \"Reviews\", and \"$4\" at the top right. A list view presents user reviews, each in a card-like format. Each card contains a circular avatar image, a user name, a star rating, and a price. Below the avatar and rating, there is a line of body text. A bottom navigation bar with three icons is present."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, light color palette...\n\nA modal screen with rounded corners and a green header containing the title \"Details\" and a small icon. Below the header is a block of body text and a \"Buy\" button. Subsequent card components are stacked vertically, each containing a title, star ratings, and a price. The cards also include additional details such as review counts and placeholder text. Each card has a slightly different layout and information hierarchy."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean style, light green and white color palette.\n\nApp screen displaying a list of card components with rounded corners. Each card contains a circular avatar image on the left, with star ratings and numerical data to the right. Each card also contains a title and additional descriptive text. Some cards have a call to action button on the right side. The top of the screen has a title bar with a title and a back button. A prominent title \"Details\" is placed below the title bar. A smaller text element indicating \"$4 Reviews\" is positioned in the upper right corner."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, light color palette with a green accent.\n\nThe screen displays a \"Details\" title at the top left. Below, a list view presents user reviews, each row containing a circular avatar image, a title, a subtitle, a star rating, and a numerical price tag on the right. The bottom navigation bar is green, with a numerical value on the left and a \"Buy\" button on the right."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode, with a muted gray and yellow color palette, and a clean, modern aesthetic.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and a currency indicator. Below, a segmented control with \"Details\" selected. A \"Buy\" button with a numerical price is present. A list view displays user reviews, each with a circular avatar, user name, rating stars, and a numerical price. Each list item also contains smaller, unreadable text. A bottom section with unreadable text is present."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern e-commerce theme, muted gray and green color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a product details view, with a title bar at the top. Below is a dark-themed section with product title, price, and review count. A horizontal row of star icons and a \"Buy\" button are present. A white card component overlays the dark section, containing a circular avatar image, user name, star ratings, and a numerical value. Additional product information and action buttons are arranged below, with placeholder text and a prominent green primary CTA button. A bottom navigation bar with icons is at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, muted gray color palette with an accent primary color.\n\nThe screen displays a \"Details\" view with a back arrow in the top right. Below the title is a search bar labeled \"Back reviews.\" The content area features a list view of card components displaying star ratings and prices. Each card includes a title, a subtitle, and some include a small icon. One card has a primary CTA button labeled \"Buy Buy\". The list continues with similar card layouts, each containing star ratings, prices, and descriptive text."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean style, light color palette with green accents...\n\nThe screen displays a list view of items, each within a card-like container. Each item includes a circular avatar image, a title, a star rating, and additional descriptive text. A numerical price tag is present on most items. Some items have a green button with text on the right side. The top of the screen features a prominent \"Details\" title on the left and a search icon on the right. A standard Android bottom navigation bar is visible at the bottom."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, light color palette with green accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of user profiles. Each list item contains a circular avatar image, a user name, a star rating, and a price on the right side. Some items also include a secondary text label and a checkmark or cloud icon. The top app bar displays the title \"Details\" on the left and an icon on the right. A green line is placed below the app bar. A section title is placed before the last two items."}]}
{"sample_id": "57388_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top banner with a prominent title and a circular 'add' FAB. Below, a card component displays list items with titles and descriptions. A rounded rectangle button is present. The lower section contains a list view with icons and corresponding titles, each followed by a circular outline. A bottom navigation icon is visible."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and action icons. Below, a progress indicator displays \"0/27 events achieved.\" The main content area presents a vertical list of card components, each representing an event or challenge. Each card contains a stylized image, a title, and descriptive text. Some cards have an expandable section. A bottom navigation bar is visible with several icons."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, bright teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a list view of events on a white card with rounded corners. Each list item contains a small icon representing the event, a title, and a subtitle. A \"more options\" icon is placed on the right of each item. The top bar contains a back button, the app's logo, and a settings icon. A progress indicator is displayed below the logo."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, bright yellow and teal color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and action icons. Below, a teal card displays progress metrics and descriptive text. A list view presents a series of challenges or tasks, each with a circular icon, a title, and a numerical value on the right. The list is divided by a horizontal rule and a section title. Each list item includes a title and a supporting text element."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, whimsical theme, bright color palette with turquoise background and rainbow accents.\n\nThe screen features a title at the top, followed by a numerical progress indicator. A plus icon is positioned at the top right. Below, a section titled \"Drink Events achieved\" with a \"Goldens\" label to the right. A list view displays card components, each containing a drink icon, a title, and descriptive text. Numerical data is aligned to the right of each card. A crescent moon and star graphic are at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with an avatar and the app name. Below, a card displays \"events achieved\" with navigation arrows. A list view presents various challenges or tasks, each in a separate card with a distinct background color. Each list item includes an icon, a title, and descriptive text."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list of challenges. At the top is a rounded card with a colorful background and a title, subtitle, and body text. Below the card is a list view with challenge names and associated numerical values on the right. Each list item also includes a small icon representing the challenge. The top app bar contains a back button on the left and the app title centered."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, with a teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list of challenges. Each challenge is presented in a rounded rectangle card with a white fill. Each card contains an icon on the left and a title to the right. A chevron icon is placed on the right side of each card. Above the list is a title, a subtitle indicating progress, and another line of text indicating status."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, bright teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and menu icon. Below is a progress indicator displaying \"0/27 events achieved\". A list view follows, with each item on a yellow card containing a colored icon and a title. At the bottom, a stylized background image sits behind two smaller image cards and a prominent pink FAB with a plus icon."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a prominent title at the top. Below, a rounded yellow card with a plus icon, text indicating progress, and a bone icon. A list view follows, each item with a circular icon on the left and descriptive text on the right. The bottom of the screen displays another progress indicator with an icon."}]}
{"sample_id": "iphone_IMG_9359_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light color palette with subtle grays and whites.\n\nThe layout features a grid of hero images at the top, each with overlaid text labels. Below, there's a section with a title and subtitle. A search bar with a magnifying glass icon and placeholder text is present, followed by a price tag. A card component with a logo is on the right. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of product images is displayed, each with an icon and label in a bottom navigation style."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with subtle gray accents.\n\nThe layout features a full-width hero image at the top with overlaid text for category titles and a segmented control below. Below the hero section is a product listing with two items displayed horizontally, each with a product image and a title. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present, and a badge notification is visible in the top right corner of the product listing. The top app bar contains a title and circular icons."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode, grayscale with white accents...\n\nThe screen displays a product listing for an online store. At the top, a hero section features a blurred background image with \"SHOP\" text and a search icon. Below, a horizontal scrollable list displays \"Women Features\" with product images and price tags. The main content area shows a grid layout of product cards, each with a \"New\" or \"Mep\" badge, a product image, a title, and price information. A bottom navigation bar provides icons for Home, Wishlist, Search, and Account."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist e-commerce theme, neutral color palette with ample whitespace.\n\nThe layout features a full-width hero image at the top, overlaid with a search bar containing a back arrow and search icon. Below the hero image are product category labels. A grid of product cards displays item images, titles, descriptions, and pricing information. Each card includes a product image, product name, price, and a sale price tag. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for account, cart, and other navigation actions."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with white backgrounds and dark accents.\n\nThe screen features a hero image at the top with a \"Shop\" label and search icon. Below the hero, a prominent title reads \"Men & Featured.\" A grid layout displays product images of shoes, each with a category label (e.g., \"Homen,\" \"Boys,\" \"Girls\") and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for home, search, back, and other actions. The overall layout emphasizes whitespace and clean lines."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, muted gray and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a logo and utility icons. Below, a horizontal navigation bar with text labels. A segmented control displays \"Women\" and \"Girls\" above product images. A \"New & Featured\" section precedes a grid of product cards, each with a product image, title, description, and price. A bottom navigation bar provides quick access to different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon on the left and a search icon on the right, sandwiching a prominent \"Shop\" title. Below is a large hero image. A horizontal section follows with a title and a right-pointing arrow. Below this are two product cards, each containing a product image, title, description, and price. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, grayscale color palette with subtle contrast.\n\nApp bar with a prominent title \"Shop\" and a search icon. Below, a horizontal scrollable category list. A hero image featuring models and overlaid text. Below the hero, a title \"Wonpe!\". A two-column grid layout displaying product cards with shoe images, product titles, and numerical price tags. Bottom navigation bar with icons for different sections."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, e-commerce theme, light color palette...\n\nA grid layout displays product cards with clothing and shoe images. Each card includes a product image, a title, and a numerical price tag. The top navigation bar contains category labels and a search icon. A bottom navigation bar is present with standard icons. Small icons for \"save\" and \"share\" are on each card."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light gray and black color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and title text. Below is a section with a title. A horizontal scrollable list displays product cards with placeholder images, category labels, prices, and a small icon. A \"Search\" label is positioned to the right. A grid layout displays additional product cards with placeholder images. A bottom navigation bar is present with standard navigation icons."}]}
{"sample_id": "12922_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and icons. Below is a horizontal scrollable tab bar. The main content area displays a grid list of card components, each containing a hero image, title, subtitle, and additional details like price and location. A bottom navigation bar provides access to different sections of the app. The card components have a subtle drop shadow for elevation. A circular floating action button is on the right side of the card."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a clean white and green color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with a back button, app title, map link, star ratings, and a search icon. Below, a segmented control offers \"For You,\" \"Homes,\" \"Experiences,\" and \"Places\" options. A large hero image showcases a tropical resort. Below the image is a title, star rating, and short description. A horizontal list view displays card components with property images, titles, and descriptions. A bottom navigation bar provides quick access to key app sections."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, teal and white color palette. The screen features a top app bar with back navigation and location/date input fields. Below is a hero image showcasing a waterfront scene with a title and subtitle overlaid. A horizontal scrollable list of card components displays property listings, each with a star rating, title, and location. A bottom navigation bar provides access to different sections of the app. Text elements include price tags and location labels."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with text labels and a prominent title \"London\" with a dropdown indicator. Below is a hero image showcasing a resort. A title is present, followed by a horizontal carousel of card components, each displaying a property image, title text, star ratings, and a numerical price tag. Pagination dots indicate more cards are available. A bottom navigation bar with icon buttons is present for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back icon, a search bar with placeholder text, and a search icon. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of text labels. A hero image follows, overlaid with three rounded cards containing titles, star ratings, and numerical price tags. A white card component with a title and body text is present, followed by a horizontal scrollable list of image cards. A bottom navigation bar with text labels and icons is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, cool color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with a menu icon and title text. Below is a horizontal scrollable filter bar. The main content area displays a card with a hero image, a price tag, title text, and supporting labels. A secondary horizontal scrollable list of cards with placeholder images and labels is present. A bottom navigation bar with icons is also visible."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, light teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a travel app interface, starting with a search bar at the top. Below, a hero image with rounded corners showcases a destination, overlaid with a title and a \"Map\" button. Underneath, a card displays \"Privat room ppienicess\" and \"Reviews.\" A grid layout follows, presenting property listings with images, titles, star ratings, and prices. Each listing card also contains a secondary button. A bottom navigation bar with icons provides main app functions."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, teal theme, with a clean and modern aesthetic.\n\nThe layout features a top navigation bar with text labels and a profile icon. Below, there's a section with a title and subtitle, followed by a horizontal scrollable list of card components, each containing a hero image, title, and pricing information. A second horizontal scrollable list of cards is present. A bottom navigation bar with icons provides main navigation."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel App theme, Teal and White color palette.\n\nThe screen features a search bar at the top, followed by a title and subtitle. A card component with rounded corners displays a hero image of a house and a rating section. Below the card is a title, supporting text, and a primary button. A horizontal scrollable list of image cards is present. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a search input and a filter icon. Below, a card component displays \"FOR YOU, HOMES\" with a hero image of a coastal city. The card includes details like \"SAVEI $7, HOME,\" \"MAP,\" star ratings, and a \"FLLTERS\" link. Two primary CTAs are placed at the bottom of the card. Another card with a similar layout showcases \"'TRAM CPNETIANENS\" with a hero image of a harbor. A bottom navigation bar with three icons is present."}]}
{"sample_id": "3457_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen features a prominent title at the top, followed by a secondary text description. Below, there are two primary CTAs: a Facebook login button with the Facebook 'f' logo and a contrasting button labeled \"Need help?\". A smaller text element is centered below the buttons. Two rectangular buttons are at the bottom of the screen, each with a short text label."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with a prominent title and subtitle at the top. Below is a text element, followed by a primary CTA button with rounded corners. A \"Need help?\" text link is centered below the button. A secondary button with a white fill is placed below the link. Finally, a toggle switch and a text element are at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple and white color palette. The screen features a full-screen background fill.\n\nA prominent title is at the top, followed by a subtitle. Below is a text element acting as a divider. Two primary CTAs with rounded corners are stacked vertically, each containing an icon on the left and descriptive text on the right. Below these is a text element and a final rounded corner button."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen presents a login interface. A prominent title is at the top, followed by a subtitle with a call to action. A horizontal divider separates the title area from the authentication options. A primary button with rounded corners is present, followed by a secondary button. Below the buttons, there is a help link."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple and white color palette. The screen features a title at the top, followed by a \"Login with Facebook\" button with an icon, and a \"Login with Google\" button below. A text link \"Need login\" is present. Below that is a \"Login help?\" button. A back arrow and text are present, followed by another button."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, purple and blue color palette...\n\nThe screen features a centered logo at the top, followed by a prominent title and a short tagline. Below this, there is a block of body text. Two primary CTAs are horizontally aligned: a blue \"Facebook\" button and a pink button with an icon. Two additional buttons are placed below, also horizontally aligned."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, purple and blue color palette. The screen features a title text at the top, followed by a primary CTA button. Below is a horizontal arrangement of two buttons, \"Need help\" and \"Google\". A subtitle precedes a card component containing placeholder text and shapes representing user avatars. Finally, a full-width primary button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title text at the top, followed by a rounded primary CTA button with an icon and text. Below that, there is a smaller text link. A secondary rounded button with an icon and text is placed below the link. Finally, there is a block of body text at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with a prominent title and subtitle at the top. Below, there are four rectangular buttons stacked vertically. The first button is white with the text \"Login with Faooglk?\". The second button is blue with the text \"Ligin with Google\". The third button is purple with the text \"Stead help?\". The fourth button is white with the text \"Need help\". Each button serves as a tappable area for user interaction."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with a prominent title and a line of supporting text. Below, there are four rounded rectangle buttons: \"Login F Facebook\" with a Facebook logo, \"Login with Google?\", \"Other login\", and \"Need help!\". Each button contains text. The background is a solid purple color."}]}
{"sample_id": "2208_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, bright color palette...\n\nThe screen features a hero image of a cityscape at the top, overlaid with a title and subtitle. A circular badge sits in the upper right. Below the hero image is a list item with a circular icon on the left, followed by a title, and a numerical value on the right. The background is a light gray."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light mode with a clean, bright color palette.\n\nThe screen features a back button and title at the top, followed by a prominent title \"Where do want to go?\". A full-width hero image with rounded corners displays a cityscape. Below, a section labeled \"Explore\" includes a title and placeholder body text. Another full-width image card is presented below, also with rounded corners, showcasing a similar cityscape view."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel-themed, Muted dark blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and a hamburger menu. Below is a prominent title. A card component with rounded corners contains the \"Explore\" label and a user icon. Inside the card is a hero image of a cityscape. Below the image are a title and subtitle, followed by a horizontal list of chip components."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel App theme, light color palette with subtle shadows...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button, app title, and profile icons. Below is a title and a hero image showcasing a city skyline. A grid layout displays three smaller card components, each with a city image, title, and a short description. Below the grid, a horizontal scroll view presents rounded cards with placeholder images and titles. Small dots indicate pagination."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel themed, Light blue and white color palette. The screen features a hero section with a search icon at the top right and a prominent title on the top left. Below is a secondary title and a subtitle. A large card component contains a city skyline image. Inside the card is a primary CTA button."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and icon. Below is a prominent search input field with rounded corners and a dropdown affordance. A full-screen hero image of a cityscape is displayed. Below the image is a card with a title and subtitle. A small icon is placed at the bottom right of the card."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list of travel destinations. At the top is an app bar with a back button and title. Below, a large card with rounded corners contains a hero image of a city skyline and a prominent title. A smaller card with a similar image and title follows. Below these cards is a section with a title and descriptive text. A horizontal row of icon-labeled buttons is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean travel app, cool dark blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and the title \"Your trips.\" Below is a search bar with the prompt \"Where you want to go?\" and an \"Explore\" button on the right. The main content area displays a list of travel destinations in card components, each featuring a hero image of a city skyline, a prominent title, and a smaller text label underneath. The cards are arranged in a vertical scrollable list, with the first card taking up the full width and subsequent cards displayed in a two-column grid layout."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light color palette with a focus on whitespace and photographic imagery.\n\nThe screen features a title at the top left, followed by a prominent question prompt and a secondary text link. Below, a full-width hero image showcases a cityscape. A horizontal scrollable list of card components with rounded corners is at the bottom; each card contains a placeholder image and a text label."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a cool blue and white color palette and a semi-transparent dark overlay.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero image of the New York City skyline. At the top, there's a segmented control with \"Explore\" and \"Your trips\" labels. Below, a prominent search input field with rounded corners and placeholder text. Overlaid on the hero image, near the bottom, is a card with a location icon and the text \"New York,\" followed by another line of descriptive text. The bottom portion of the image fades to a dark gradient overlay."}]}
{"sample_id": "5334_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\n\nA grid layout displaying various card components, each featuring a square image placeholder. Below each image is a title and a short description. A small dropdown icon is positioned to the right of each title. A bottom navigation bar with icons for different sections is present. The images appear to be lifestyle-related."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a grid-based layout of cards. Each card contains a rounded image placeholder, followed by a title and additional descriptive text. The top navigation bar includes a back button, a title, and action icons. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present for primary navigation. The card images appear to be lifestyle photography. Each card also contains a row of dots, likely indicating additional options or actions."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, dark mode color palette with white accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button on the left and the Pinterest logo centered, and a circular profile button on the right. Below the app bar is a search bar with placeholder text. The main content area displays a grid of rounded-corner card components, each containing an image and a title. The images include a cup, a woman's lips, a snowman, and food items. Each card has a title text below the image."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and bright, with a predominantly white and red color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with the Pinterest logo and utility icons. Below, a section with a title and a heart icon. The main content area displays a grid layout of image cards, each featuring a photograph above a title and user attribution. A bottom navigation bar with standard icons is present for primary navigation. The images appear to be lifestyle and food-related."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Pinterest-inspired, with a vibrant red and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a two-column grid layout of rounded-corner card components, each containing a relevant lifestyle image. The top app bar displays the app logo and title. Some cards include overlaid text, such as a call to action button or a title. A small chevron icon is present on one of the cards, indicating an expandable section. The images showcase various themes, including beauty, food, and crafts."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode, with a minimalist aesthetic and a muted gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and the Pinterest logo. Below is a search bar with rounded corners and placeholder text. A grid layout displays various card components, each containing an image and associated text. The images include lifestyle shots and product photography. Each card has a title and numerical data below the image. A bottom navigation bar is present with standard navigation icons."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a Pinterest-like grid layout with four rounded-corner card components. Each card contains a different image. The top left card features an image with the text \"Expand\" and \"whispe\" overlaid. The top right card has a dark background with white text. The bottom two cards display lifestyle images. Below the cards are labels and a bottom navigation bar with five circular icons. A back arrow is in the top left and a search icon is in the top right. The Pinterest logo is centered at the top."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, neutral color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a grid layout of image cards with rounded corners. Each card contains a placeholder image, a title text label underneath, and a heart icon for liking. The top navigation bar includes a logo on the left, a title in the center, and a hamburger menu icon on the right. The images are lifestyle-themed."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with red accent.\n\nThe screen features a Pinterest home feed layout with a top app bar containing a logo and a profile button. Below, a grid of rounded-corner card components displays various images. Each card contains a relevant image. Some cards contain text elements. The grid layout presents the images in a visually appealing manner."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, dark mode theme with a minimalist aesthetic.\n\nA grid layout displays six rounded-corner cards, each containing an image or text. The top left card features a snowman image, and the top right shows a food image. The middle left card displays a cup, while the middle right card contains a text block. The bottom left card shows a cup, and the bottom right shows a cat. A bottom navigation bar contains four icons. A Pinterest logo is in the top right corner, and the word \"Expand\" is in the top left corner."}]}
{"sample_id": "14976_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, cool blue and white color palette. The screen features a full-bleed hero image with a blurred background. A prominent title is overlaid on the image, followed by a subtitle and a location description. Below, there are two horizontally arranged primary CTAs. Further down, two secondary buttons are presented, each with descriptive text. The top navigation bar includes a logo on the left and action icons on the right."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, with a blue and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top logo section, followed by a prominent title and a search input field with rounded corners. Below the input, there is descriptive body text. Two prominent, rounded-corner buttons with icons and labels are horizontally aligned. The background displays a blurred image, likely a lifestyle hero image. Whitespace provides visual separation between elements."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a hero image with a blurred background and the realtor.com logo in the upper left, and a hamburger menu icon on the right. Below the hero image is a prominent title and a subtitle. Two rounded buttons, one white with a gray outline and one solid blue, are arranged horizontally with text inside. Below that is a \"Search nearby\" label and two more rounded buttons, one white with a gray outline and one solid blue, arranged horizontally with text inside."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Real Estate theme, cool blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a blurred hero image background with the realtor.com logo at the top. Below is a title text element and a prominent search bar with a search icon. Two buttons labeled \"OR\" and \"LOGIN\" are horizontally aligned. Below, two more buttons labeled \"Search by contrd/\" and \"Search newwby\" are horizontally aligned. A slider is placed above a primary CTA button labeled \"FARAN\"."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean real estate theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a blurred background image.\n\nThe layout includes a top-aligned logo, a prominent title, and a horizontal navigation bar with text labels. Below, there's a search input field, followed by two primary buttons with text labels. An \"OR\" separator is placed between the buttons and a final button at the bottom. Each button has rounded corners. Text labels are used to indicate input field hints."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a full-bleed background image with a search interface layered on top. A prominent text field with a label is at the top, followed by a descriptive text element. Below, there are two additional text fields. Two buttons are placed side-by-side, each with a filled top half and a white bottom half containing the text \"OR\". The app's logo is at the very top."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a hero section with a blurred building image, a prominent title, and a subtitle. Below, there's a search section with the title and two buttons, \"For Sale\" and \"FOR RENT\". Below these are two more buttons, one light and one dark, with text. Finally, a primary CTA button spans the width of the screen at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features the realtor.com logo at the top, followed by a back arrow and a text label. Below, there are two rounded-corner input fields labeled \"FOR SIG ON\" and \"FOR RENT\". Underneath the input fields is a line of body text. Two primary CTAs, \"Search fruanwing\" and \"Search newrbby\", are horizontally aligned at the bottom of the content area. The background is a blurred image."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, cool blue color palette...\n\nThe screen features a blurred hero image background. At the top is a logo and a \"Sign Up\" link. A prominent title reads \"Start your search\". Below is a search input field with rounded corners and placeholder text. Body text provides instructions for the search. Two primary CTAs are horizontally aligned, each with a text label."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a hero image background with a semi-transparent overlay. At the top is a logo and a hamburger menu icon. Below, a prominent title reads \"Start your search\". A search input field is present, followed by two columns of buttons. Each column contains a primary button with text and a secondary button labeled \"OR\". Body text is placed above each column, providing context for the search options."}]}
{"sample_id": "Rico_2349_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, blue and yellow color palette. The screen displays a login form with a full-screen background image.\n\nThe layout includes a title at the top left, followed by input fields for username and password with labels above. A \"Remember Me\" checkbox is present. Below the password field, there is a link for \"Login Recovery\" and a primary CTA button labeled \"Log In\" with a yellow fill. The background image appears to be a truck."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, corporate theme, blue and yellow color palette. The screen features a login form overlayed on a background image of a truck.\n\nThe layout includes a logo at the top, followed by a username text field with placeholder text, a password text field with obscured input, and a primary CTA button labeled \"LOG IN\" in a contrasting yellow. Above the password field is a smaller text label. Below the password field are two smaller text links, one on each side. The background image is partially obscured by a solid blue overlay."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, corporate theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a logo graphic of a truck at the top, followed by a prominent title. Below, there are input fields for username and password, each with a corresponding label and supporting icons. A horizontal rule separates these fields from \"Account Recovery/Logil\" text. A white modal appears at the bottom with a \"Login\" title, input fields, \"New Account\" text, and a primary \"Log In\" CTA button."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, corporate theme, blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a login interface with stacked input fields for \"Username\" and \"Password,\" each with a rounded rectangle container. Below the password field is a \"Remember Me\" checkbox. An \"Account Recovery\" link is centered below. A primary \"Log 