{"sample_id": "25260_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a hero image with a stylized folder and document graphic. Below is a prominent title and supporting body text. Two radio button options are presented, each with associated descriptive text. A \"Send OTP\" button is placed above a full-width primary CTA button labeled \"Skip.\" The background is a solid blue color."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a stylized illustration of a phone being held by a hand at the top. Inside the phone illustration are placeholder elements. Below is a prominent title and descriptive body text. A small button is placed above a white card with rounded corners. Inside the card is a \"Skip\" button, a price tag, and a primary CTA at the bottom."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, blue and white color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top section with abstract graphics of a phone and document. Below is a prominent title and supporting body text. A white modal occupies the lower half, containing a title \"Send OTP Kwik\", followed by a phone number. Two buttons are horizontally aligned at the bottom of the modal: a white secondary button labeled \"Silk\" and a blue primary CTA labeled \"Skip\"."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, clean aesthetic, with a blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a stylized graphic of a mobile phone at the top, with placeholder text inside. Below is a prominent title text block. A \"Skip\" button is centered below the title. Body text is present, followed by a numerical value. A horizontal rule separates this from additional text and an icon. A primary CTA button spans the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, dark blue theme with a gradient, and a vibrant blue accent color.\n\nThe screen features a hero image with a stylized phone and document graphic at the top. Below is a block of descriptive text, followed by a \"Send OTP!\" label and a smaller \"Pre [Number] Recharge\" text. Two primary CTA buttons with rounded corners are stacked vertically, each containing the word \"Skip\". The background is a gradient dark blue."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, cool blue color palette with white accents.\n\nThe screen features a stylized phone mockup with a logo and list items at the top. Below is a prominent title and subtitle text block, followed by a smaller text line. A primary CTA button is centered below the text. Underneath, there is a horizontal row of price tags. A final, secondary CTA button is placed at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a rounded top section with a stylized document graphic and a prominent title. Below, there's a subtitle and a \"Send OTP\" heading. An input field with a label and a placeholder number is present, followed by a secondary button-like element with a numerical value. A primary CTA button labeled \"Skip\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, dark blue and light blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features an illustration of documents at the top, followed by a prominent title and a subtitle. Below are pagination dots. A smaller title is present, followed by a text field. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is at the bottom, with descriptive text below it."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark blue color palette...\n\nThe screen features a stylized illustration of a mobile phone with a hand pointing at the screen. Below this is a prominent title and a smaller subtitle. There are two rounded buttons with the text \"Skip\". Below the buttons is a text element and a pagination indicator with four dots."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark blue color palette with light blue accents.\n\nThe screen features a stylized document icon at the top, followed by a prominent title and a supporting text block. Below this, there are three circular buttons. A larger button with rounded corners is placed centrally, containing placeholder text. A row of smaller circular indicators is positioned above a set of navigation buttons at the bottom."}]}
{"sample_id": "1905_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a logo at the top, followed by an app name. Below, there's a title and a text input field, along with a 'Lost your Password' link. A subtitle precedes another title and a primary CTA button. At the bottom, two horizontally aligned buttons, 'EMAIL' and 'LOGIN', are present."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a header with a logo, followed by a welcome message. Below, there are two input fields with labels for \"Email\" and \"Password,\" each with a white background. \"Lost your password\" text is placed below the email input. A small icon is next to the text \"GNNyour free email account!\". At the bottom, there are two primary CTAs in blue, labeled \"GML\" and \"LOGII\"."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue and white color palette. The screen features a logo at the top, followed by a \"Welcome\" title. Two input fields with labels are present, followed by two horizontally arranged buttons, one a primary CTA and the other a secondary button. Below, another \"Welcome\" title and body text are displayed, followed by a text field and two more buttons at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a top app bar with the app logo. Below is a rounded rectangle with an email icon and the app name. The screen includes a welcome message, \"Lost password?\" and \"Get your account\" links. There's an input field with a placeholder text and a pencil icon. At the bottom, there are two primary rounded buttons."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a centered layout with the app logo at the top, followed by a welcome message. Below is a text field with a placeholder icon, and a link for password recovery. Another text field with a document icon is present. A \"MANUAL SETUP\" label is above the primary \"LOGIN\" CTA button. The background has a gradient effect."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a logo at the top, followed by a text field labeled \"Email.\" Below is a welcome message and a rounded button prompting users to set up a free email. Supporting text is present below the button. At the bottom, two primary CTAs labeled \"LOGIN\" are horizontally aligned."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a login form with a top section containing a logo and a large stylized number. Below, there's a welcome message and supporting text. Two input fields labeled \"Password\" are present, along with a \"Lost Password?\" link. A circular radio button and associated text are above two primary CTAs, \"SUNCAL\" and \"LOGIN,\" at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark blue color palette...\n\nThe screen features a vertically stacked login form. At the top is a logo container. Below the logo are two input fields with rounded corners and placeholder text. A title is placed below the input fields. A primary CTA button is on the right side. A text element is placed on the left side. A text element is placed at the bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, dark blue color palette. The screen features a logo at the top, followed by a welcome message. Below are two input fields with rounded corners and placeholder text. A primary CTA button labeled \"LOGIN\" is placed below the input fields. At the bottom of the screen, there is a secondary button. The screen uses ample whitespace to create a clean and uncluttered design."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, cool blue color palette. The screen features a logo at the top left, followed by a welcome message in a rectangular container. Below, a white card contains two input fields with email icons and placeholder text. Two primary buttons, \"EMAIL\" and \"LOGIN,\" are horizontally aligned. A final primary button labeled \"LOGM\" is at the bottom of the screen."}]}
{"sample_id": "56563_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, with a bright green and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a horizontal scrolling list of food items at the top, followed by a prominent green banner with a title and a \"NEW\" badge. Below is a tab bar with \"CAL,\" \"Featured,\" a price, \"My Stuff,\" and \"Search.\" A hero image showcases a restaurant exterior. Underneath, there's a title, a price, and some descriptive text. Finally, there are three circular buttons with icons and labels, and a primary \"DEAL\" button."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, light and muted color palette with a green accent.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu and action icons. Below is a prominent card component with rounded corners, a title, a search bar, and descriptive text. A \"NEW\" badge sits in the corner. A horizontal scroll view displays food items as cards with images, titles, and prices. A bottom navigation bar provides primary navigation. A FAB is placed on the card component."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Clean aesthetic, with a muted color palette of greens, whites, and dark grays.\n\nThe screen features a search bar with rounded corners and the label \"Featured,\" accompanied by a circular button containing a stylized \"W.\" Below is a card component displaying a hero image of a waterfront city. Underneath the image is a title, subtitle, and a numerical price tag. A horizontal rule separates this information from an interactive section with an input field, an icon, and a \"Search\" button. A bottom navigation bar is present."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light green and white color palette. The layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and app title. Below is a \"Featured Girl\" section with a hero image, a \"NEW\" badge, a title, and two buttons. A \"Deal's Hout\" section follows, displaying a list of items with titles, descriptions, and numerical price tags. Each item has a dropdown menu. A bottom navigation bar with three icons and labels is present."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and a menu icon. Below is a card with a hero image and title text. Underneath, a card displays a numerical price tag, a pill-shaped button, and a badge. A list view follows, with item titles and numerical price tags. Each list item contains a row of icon buttons with numerical values. A primary CTA button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern and clean, with a light teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow. Below, a segmented control with \"Featured Deal\" and \"Search Trom f\" labels. A large card component displays a hero image of a city skyline and waterfront restaurant. The card includes a \"NEW\" badge, a prominent title, and a secondary title. Below the image, there are two lines of descriptive text and a price. A list view follows, showing a row with an icon, text, and a price."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\n\nThe screen features a hero image at the top with a badge element and overlaid text. Below the hero image is a prominent title and a numerical price tag. A list view follows, displaying item names and corresponding prices. Two buttons are horizontally aligned, with one styled as a primary CTA. A bottom navigation bar with iconographic elements is present."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, with a green and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a logo and an icon button. Below is a segmented control with \"Featured\" and \"Search\" options. A hero image of a cityscape with \"New Deal\" and \"New\" badges overlays the image. Below the image is a title, price, original price with strikethrough, and a primary CTA button. A horizontal list view of card components displaying cityscapes, titles, and prices is at the bottom. The screen also has a bottom navigation bar with three icons."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Bright and Cheerful theme, Green and White color palette.\n\nThe screen features a hero image at the top with a rounded-corner card overlay containing a title, a numerical price tag, and a primary CTA button. Below the hero section is a \"Featured\" section with a horizontal list view of card components. Each card contains a placeholder image, a title, a subtitle, a numerical price tag, and icon buttons. A hamburger menu icon is in the top left corner. The bottom of the screen has standard Android navigation buttons."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, with a light color palette and subtle use of rounded corners.\n\nThe layout features a full-screen blurred background image with a green tinted overlay. A card component with rounded corners and a \"NEW\" badge is centered on the screen, containing a title, subtitle, and a price tag. A primary CTA button is placed at the bottom of the card. Below the card are two lines of illegible text with icons. A \"Featured\" label is in the top left, and a square icon is in the top right."}]}
{"sample_id": "2213_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, with a light teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen illustration of a person relaxing in bed while holding a phone. Above the illustration are two icons in the top left and right corners. Below the illustration is a prominent title, followed by a block of body text. A rounded primary CTA button with the text \"GET STARTED\" is at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, friendly theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen illustration of a person relaxing on a chair while using a phone. Below the image is a prominent title, followed by body text. A primary CTA button with rounded corners and a teal fill is at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, calming theme, teal and white color palette. The screen features a full-screen illustration of a person in bed using a phone. Below the image is a prominent title, followed by body text. A horizontal dot indicator shows the current onboarding step. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is at the bottom. A back arrow icon is in the top left corner and a menu icon is in the top right corner."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Serene Theme, Teal and White Color Palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-width hero image at the top depicting a person holding a phone. Below the image is a prominent title, followed by a smaller title acting as a call to action. Body text is placed below the title. Page indicator dots are centered below the body text. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, friendly vibe, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen illustration of a person relaxing with a phone. Below the image is a prominent title, followed by a short body of text. A 