creen layout with an illustration of a person using a phone. Above the illustration is a primary CTA button with rounded corners. Below the illustration is a prominent title, followed by body text. A secondary button is placed below the body text. At the bottom of the screen is a large, rounded primary CTA button. A status indicator is at the very top."}]}
{"sample_id": "Android_Android_58_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, cool blue and white color palette.\n\nApp bar with a back button labeled \"Sort\" on the left, a price in the center, and a \"Map\" button on the right. A hero image of a hotel with a title overlay. Below, a card component with hotel details, including a rating, price, and a button. A list view of similar hotels with preview images and descriptive text. A blue primary CTA at the bottom with left and right arrow icons and text."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of hotel options. At the top, there's an app bar with a back button and the app title. Below, a segmented control offers \"Sort,\" \"Filert,\" and \"Map\" options. Each hotel is presented in a card component with a hero image. Each card includes a title, a brief description, and a numerical price tag. A circular icon button is placed on the right side of the first card."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, with a teal accent color. The layout features a clean and modern design.\n\nApp bar at the top with the title \"Taldicts Hotel\" and a user icon on the right. Below, there is a segmented control with \"Sort,\" \"Filter,\" and \"Map\" options. A hero image of a city landscape with the text \"Sofitel London Heattrow\" overlaid. Below the hero image is a title \"Zibiseis\" followed by a horizontal list of card components. Each card contains an image, a title, some descriptive text, and two numerical price tags."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with subtle shadows.\n\nThe screen displays a list of locations. At the top is an app bar with a back button, title, search icon, and right-facing arrow. Below is a full-width hero image. Underneath the image are two lines of text, one larger and bolder than the other, followed by a price. Below that is a grid list of location cards, each containing a location image, title, price, and additional numerical data."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean theme, light gray and dark blue color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of hotel listings. Each listing is presented in a card component with rounded corners and subtle drop shadow. Each card contains a hero image of the hotel, a numerical price tag at the bottom left, and a row of icons for rating and saving. The top navigation bar contains a menu icon on the left and the title \"Sofite London Heathrow\" on the right, with a slider below. Above the list view are two labels, \"Sofittel Listings\" and two numerical values. The bottom navigation bar contains icons."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray and white color palette, and subtle drop shadows for elevation.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and a title. Below, there's a horizontal scrollable list of card components displaying travel destinations with rounded corners and placeholder images. Each card includes a title, subtitle, star ratings, and a numerical price tag. A section header with the text \"Sofiltel Listings\" is present, followed by another horizontal scrollable list of similar card components. A bottom navigation bar is visible with standard navigation icons."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a clean white color palette and subtle drop shadows.\n\nThe screen features a back button and title in the top app bar, followed by a full-width hero image of a cityscape. Below the hero, a title introduces a list of hotel options. Each hotel is presented in a card component with a rounded image, a title, and a numerical price tag. The cards are arranged in a horizontal scrolling list. A bottom navigation bar is present at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a blue and white color palette, and subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and title. Below, a secondary navigation bar contains sort, map, and location options. Two icons are on the right side of the screen. A title introduces a grid layout of card components. Each card displays a landscape image, a title, and a numerical price tag. The bottom cards have a dark blue background."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist style, light color palette with blue accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of hotel options. At the top, there's a hamburger menu icon and \"Sort\" and \"Map\" labels. Below, a \"Taable Filter\" label precedes the list. Each list item is a card with a hotel image on the left and hotel name, price, star rating, and some unreadable text on the right. The list continues with \"Excellend\" and \"Ainciinter's fin\" labels followed by similar hotel cards. The bottom navigation bar is visible at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, cool color palette with dark blue and white...\n\nThe screen displays a list view of travel destinations within card components. Each card contains a hero image, a title, and several price tags. Above the list is a tab bar with sort and filter options. Below the first card is a row of filter buttons. The top app bar contains a search icon. The bottom navigation bar has icons for different sections."}]}
{"sample_id": "33178_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, coral and dark gray color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of items. Each list item contains a thumbnail image on the left, followed by a title and a numerical price tag. A checkmark icon is placed on the right side of each item. A dark gray banner with a prominent title is positioned below the top navigation bar, which includes a hamburger menu icon on the left and a circular profile icon on the right."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with red accents.\n\nThe screen displays an \"Add new Interests\" title bar with a back button. Below is a section with a title and a grid layout of food-related cards. Each card contains a square image placeholder, a title, and some rating information. A section with a title \"Locd Drinks\" and a similar grid layout of cards follows. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean style, light color palette with a dark gray background.\n\nThe screen displays a list of selectable options. At the top is a back arrow and a search icon. Below the title text is a descriptive text block. The main content is a vertical list of card components, each containing a placeholder image representing a drink, a title, and two lines of numerical data. Each card has a chevron icon and a radio button on the right side."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, light color palette with a coral accent color.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of card components, each containing a square image placeholder, title text, subtitle text, and supporting text. Each card also includes a quantity selector with increment/decrement buttons. A prominent title bar is at the top with a back arrow and a \"DONE!\" button. A section title is present above a subset of the cards."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and clean, with a coral and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of interest options. Each list item contains a rounded-corner thumbnail image of a drink, a title, and supporting text. The first item has a \"DONE\" button on the right. Subsequent items have a coral-colored chevron icon on the right. A dark gray fixed bottom bar contains two buttons with text labels. The top app bar has a back button and a title."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, coral color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of card components with rounded corners. Each card contains a thumbnail image on the left, a title, and a numerical value. A chevron icon is on the right side of each card. Above the list is a full-width primary CTA button with the text \"Add new Done\". At the top of the screen is a prominent title. A small icon is placed in the upper left corner."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, bright white and accent red color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and action icons. Below is a hero card with a large image, title text, subtitle text, and two buttons. A list view follows, each item featuring a smaller image, title, descriptive text, a rating section, a percentage value, and a small button. Each list item is separated by whitespace. The bottom of the screen has a floating action button (FAB)."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, pastel coral and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and notification icon. Below is a prominent banner with a completion message and an upward-pointing arrow icon. A section titled \"Alcohol Intrests\" includes a title and supporting text. Two horizontal scrolling lists, labeled \"DONE\" and \"IDONE,\" display food images within card components. Each card includes a title and additional text below the image, plus a circular FAB with a plus icon on the right side of the card."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, pastel theme, light pink color palette. The screen features a list view of card components with rounded corners and subtle drop shadows. Each card contains a placeholder image, a title, and additional text details. A checkmark icon is positioned on the right side of each card. A search bar with a magnifying glass icon is present. The bottom navigation bar is dark and contains icons. A title is at the top left and a \"DONE\" button is at the top right."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and playful theme, pastel red and light gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with a back arrow and title on the left, and a download icon on the right. Below, there's a segmented control with three options. The main content area is a list view of interest categories, each with a circular thumbnail image, a title, and a numerical value. Each list item also includes a checkbox or a chevron icon on the right side. A \"DONE\" button is placed at the top right corner. The title \"Add new Interests\" is above the list."}]}
{"sample_id": "4240_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with subtle pink accents.\n\nThe screen features a hero image at the top with a brand logo and promotional text overlay. Below, a horizontal scrollable tab bar allows category selection. A grid layout displays product cards, each with a product image, title, and price. A faint horizontal rule separates the product grid from a bottom navigation bar with iconographic labels. Search and menu icons are positioned in the upper right corner."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light beige and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu, title, logo, search icon, and user icon. Below is a hero image with overlaid prominent title text. A product title and price are displayed, followed by a horizontal list view of product cards. Each card contains a product image, title, descriptive text, and a primary CTA button."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, E-commerce theme, neutral color palette with white background...\n\nThe screen features a hero image carousel with a promotional banner and product category callout. Below the carousel is a horizontal scrolling list of product cards, each displaying a product image, title, and price. Each product card contains a product image with rounded corners, product name, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present for primary navigation. The top app bar contains a back button and a profile icon."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, e-commerce theme, neutral color palette with a focus on white and light pink backgrounds.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu and back button, followed by a prominent title and subtitle. A full-width hero image showcases a lifestyle shot with overlaid text promoting a sale. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of product categories is displayed. A grid layout presents product cards, each containing a product image, title, price, and pagination dots. The bottom navigation bar is visible at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, E-commerce theme, pastel pink and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu, a search icon, and user profile icons. Below is a hero image promoting a sale. A grid of product cards displays clothing items, each with a product image, a title, star ratings, and a search icon. A numerical price tag is visible on one of the cards. The background is clean white, providing ample whitespace."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, neutral color palette with white backgrounds and subtle gray accents.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and action icons on the right. Below is a segmented control with \"OUIRE\" and \"FESTIVALE\" options. A hero image showcases a fashion item with overlaid text promoting a sale. Below the hero, a grid layout displays product cards with images, product titles, and price tags. Each card has a subtle drop shadow for elevation. The text elements are clean and legible, providing key information about the products and promotions."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, e-commerce theme, muted color palette with white backgrounds and dark accents.\n\nApp bar with back button, search icon, title text, and two icons on the right. A hero image with promotional text and a \"Women\" label. Below, a two-column grid layout of product cards. Each card contains a product image, title text, description text, price, a radio button, and a small product thumbnail."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, E-commerce theme, neutral color palette with white background...\n\nThe layout features a hero image at the top with \"LAST DAY!\" text and two icon buttons labeled \"FESTIVAL\" and \"WOMEN\". Below the hero, there is a title. The main content area displays a grid of product cards, each containing a product image, a prominent title, and a secondary text element. The text content within the cards is likely product names and promotional information."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, fashion-forward theme, light pastel color palette with a focus on whitespace and clean typography.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu, title text, and icons for wishlist and search. Below is a hero banner with lifestyle images and promotional text. The main content area presents product categories in a grid layout with image thumbnails, product names, and numerical price tags. Each section has a title and a chevron icon for expansion. A bottom navigation bar is present with a central icon."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and playful theme, pink and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon, app title, search icon, and user profile icon. Below is a hero image carousel with promotional text and a lifestyle image. A horizontal product list view displays clothing items, each with a product image, name, and price. The product list is arranged in a grid layout. Each product has a title and a numerical price tag."}]}
{"sample_id": "408_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a signup form with a centered icon at the top. Below the icon is a text block. The form consists of four rounded text input fields with placeholder text and icons on the left. Below the input fields are two rounded buttons, the top one with text and the bottom one labeled \"SIGN UP\"."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen displays a sign-up form with an icon at the top, followed by a prominent title. Below, there are two input fields with labels above them. Another input field is present for password confirmation. A checkbox and a white box with a checkmark are displayed. Below, there is a text block and a primary CTA button at the bottom."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a logo at the top, followed by a statement regarding terms and conditions. Below this, a rounded white card contains three input fields labeled \"Name,\" \"Email,\" and \"Password,\" each with a horizontal line underneath. The password field has a small eye icon on the right. Below the input fields, there is a row of asterisks and a rounded primary CTA button labeled \"SUBIT.\""}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a prominent logo at the top, followed by a text block describing terms and privacy policy. Below is a form contained within a white card, including input fields for name, email, password, and confirm password, each with a corresponding label. Checkmarks indicate completion for some fields. A radio button is present before the last field. A primary CTA button labeled \"SUBMIT\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen displays a login form with a logo at the top. Below the logo is a text block, followed by two input fields labeled \"Email\" and \"Password,\" each with a checkbox. Below the input fields is a text block, and a primary CTA button labeled \"SUBMIT.\" A circular element is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a signup form with a logo at the top. Below the logo is a text field labeled \"Name\". Underneath is a text block describing terms and conditions. Below that are input fields for \"Email\" and \"Password\" with associated icons. There are two more input fields with icons. At the bottom is a block of text and a primary CTA button labeled \"SUBMIT\"."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette with a gradient background.\n\nThe screen displays a sign-up form with a top navigation bar containing a back button and the app title. Below, a logo is centered above the \"Sign Up\" title and a text blurb. The form consists of four input fields labeled \"Name,\" \"Email,\" \"Email,\" and \"Password,\" each with a corresponding icon. A primary CTA button labeled \"SUBMIT\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, blue color palette...\n\nThe screen presents a form with a logo at the top. Below the logo are two icons. The form consists of input fields labeled \"Name,\" \"Email,\" \"Porrail,\" and \"Priacy,\" each with a corresponding underline. Below the input fields are two buttons labeled \"Read acted cof password\" and \"Confirmp password\". A primary CTA button labeled \"SUBMIT\" is prominently displayed. Below the CTA is a block of body text, followed by smaller text and another line of text at the bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette. The screen features a central layout with a logo at the top. Below the logo is a series of four input fields with rounded corners and placeholder text. Each input field has a corresponding icon on the left. Below the input fields is a text block, followed by a primary CTA button at the bottom."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and white color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a form-like layout with a logo at the top, followed by a text disclaimer. Below are four input fields with rounded corners and icons on the left, each containing placeholder text. Underneath the input fields is a smaller text element, and finally, a prominent primary CTA button at the bottom."}]}
{"sample_id": "iphone_IMG_8773_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette...\n\nA full-screen product detail view features a hero image at the top with a \"Cancel\" button and product title in the upper left and right corners. A heart icon is positioned on the right side of the image. Below the image, there's a product title and price, followed by additional product details and prices. A horizontal list view displays product images."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with white and gray tones.\n\nThe screen features a product detail view with a large product image at the top, overlaid with a save button on the left and a cancel button on the right. Above the image are a menu icon on the left and a search and add icon on the right. Below the main image is a product title, followed by a star rating and additional product details. A row of smaller images showing product variations is displayed at the bottom."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, light color palette with purple accents.\n\nThe layout features a product details screen with a hero image carousel at the top, displaying yarn. Below the image is a prominent title and subtitle indicating the product name and size. A heart icon is present for saving the product. A card component contains product information, including a title, price, and a \"Save\" primary CTA button. Additional product options are listed as bullet points with corresponding prices. A bottom navigation bar is visible."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with beige accents.\n\nThe layout features a full-width hero image at the top, with a back arrow and heart icon in the corners. Below the image is a title and subtitle, followed by a star rating and additional descriptive text. A \"Save\" button is positioned to the right. Below this is a price display. A horizontal scrollable list of card components with product images and labels is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, with a muted pastel color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and title text. Below is a product detail view with a hero image. Product title and description text are placed below the image, followed by a price and save indicator. Two horizontal buttons are present, with text labels. A horizontal scrollable list of product images is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, light color palette with subtle pink accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and title. Below, there are two primary buttons, \"Save\" and \"Cancel.\" A central hero image displays a product, with a heart icon for saving. Product details include a title and description, followed by a price. A horizontal list view displays related product images with prices and descriptions. The top right corner contains icons for sharing and favoriting."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, clean white background.\n\nThe screen features a product detail view with a large rounded-corner hero image at the top. Above the image are \"back\" and \"cancel\" buttons. Below the hero image is a prominent title, followed by a price and a secondary price with a dropdown. Below that is some smaller text. A horizontal scrolling list of product cards with placeholder images is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with subtle earth tones.\n\nThe screen features a full-width hero image showcasing a model. In the top corners are a heart icon and a hamburger menu icon. Below the hero image are icons for like, comment, and save. Below that is a title, a subtitle, and a price. There are three small circles indicating color options. Below that is a horizontal scrollable list of product images."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette...\n\nThe screen features a product listing with a top app bar containing a hamburger menu, title, close icon, and a heart icon. Below, there are two product cards with rounded corners, each displaying a lifestyle hero image. Product information, including a title, description, and numerical price tag, is placed below each card. There are also segmented controls, a primary CTA button, and a bottom navigation bar."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, muted gray color palette...\n\nThe layout features a product detail screen with a top app bar containing a logo and a heart icon. Below, a card component displays a product image, followed by a product title and details. A horizontal list of filter chips is present. The product description and price are displayed, followed by a primary CTA button and two secondary buttons with icons. Another product image is visible at the bottom, suggesting a scrollable list."}]}
{"sample_id": "31143_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, teal and gray color palette, with a modern, minimalist aesthetic.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and app title. Below, there are two horizontal buttons with icons and text labels. A section titled \"Improve I station\" has two gray buttons labeled \"Live Staturs\" and \"Live Times\". A \"Features\" section displays text and two more buttons. A list view with icons and text follows, and a primary CTA button at the bottom with rounded corners and a teal fill."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a \"Plan & Buy\" section with fields for \"Depart station\" and \"Arrival station.\" A search input field contains the placeholder text \"Find trains.\" Below, a white card with rounded corners displays a suitcase icon and the text \"Ta u trow.\" A bottom navigation bar contains several icons. The top navigation bar has a back arrow on the left and a title on the right."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title bar with a back button and app title. Below are three prominent teal-colored buttons with white text labels. A floating action button (FAB) is positioned to the right of the third button. A card component with rounded corners is at the bottom, containing a title, descriptive text, and two buttons displaying numerical price tags. Below are additional text labels and buttons with numerical values."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon and logo. Below, a segmented control with \"PLAN & BUY\" and \"LIVE TIMES\" options. A \"PLAN TRAINS\" section follows, with input fields for departure and arrival locations, and a toggle switch. A prominent call-to-action button labeled \"LIVE TIDAY\" is centrally placed. A list view with icons and descriptive text follows, and a final primary CTA at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, teal and dark gray color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a form-like layout. It features a title bar with left-aligned and right-aligned elements. Below, there are sections labeled \"Departure station\" and \"Arrival station,\" each followed by descriptive text and input fields. A prominent teal-colored button is present, along with two smaller buttons at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, teal and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and the title \"PLAN & BUY\". Below, there's a prominent search input field labeled \"Departun station\" and a \"LIVE\" button. A section titled \"Impartture live times features\" includes a \"Arrival\" dropdown. A card with an icon and the text \"Find Times\" is displayed, along with a yellow \"Find Times\" button. A list view follows, with each item containing an icon and text, such as \"Arruna Station\", \"Inclarad\", \"T Inmass Rsation\", and \"Ewall Dospnpentes\", the last one with a chevron."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and back button. Below is a prominent title, followed by a card component containing icons and descriptive text. A title indicates a section, followed by a segmented control with two options. Below, a list view displays items with icons and placeholder text. Each item includes a title and numerical values. A primary CTA button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, teal and orange color palette.\n\nThe screen features two sections, \"PLAN ART & BUY\" and \"LIVE TIMES,\" each with a dropdown selection. Below is a full-width primary CTA button. A section with a title and subtitle is followed by a graphic element. A list view with titles and icons is presented, each with a chevron."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, teal and dark gray color palette. The screen displays a \"Plan & Buy\" title at the top left and a train icon at the top right. Below is a segmented control with \"Departraim\" and \"Live Times\" options. A card component contains a title and a primary CTA button labeled \"Find trains\". Below is an \"Arrival station\" title, followed by two list items, each containing an icon and descriptive text. A numerical price tag is displayed in the second list item. A pagination indicator is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and an icon button on the right. Below, there's a search input field. A list of cards follows, each containing an icon on the left and descriptive text on the right. A call to action button is placed below the cards. Finally, another list of cards with icons and text labels is displayed at the bottom."}]}
{"sample_id": "34217_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen is divided into two sections. The top section features a dark teal background with a prominent title and body text, followed by a rounded primary CTA button. The bottom section displays a hero image, partially visible, with a circular teal overlay."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a hero section with a large title text at the top, followed by a primary CTA button with rounded corners and a smaller text label underneath. Below this section, there is a card component with rounded corners containing a landscape image. A text element is placed at the bottom of the card."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern and clean aesthetic, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen hero section with a large title and a search bar-like input field. Below the fold, a full-width image displays a scenic view. Two card components are arranged horizontally, each containing a title, subtitle, and some numerical data. A horizontal line separates these cards from another card below."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, dark color palette with a vibrant accent color.\n\nThe screen is divided into two sections. The top section features a dark background with a prominent title, a subtitle, and a short paragraph of body text. A rounded primary CTA button with a contrasting fill color is placed below the text. The bottom section displays a lifestyle hero image of a tropical pool."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding screen, dark color palette with a teal accent.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen layout with a prominent title text block at the top. Below the title is a large, rounded primary CTA button filled with the teal accent color and white text. The bottom of the screen has a curved teal shape."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, teal and white color palette. The screen features a full-screen hero image of a mountain landscape.\n\nAt the top is a back arrow icon and a rounded search input field with the word \"Now\" inside. Below the search input is a large title text block. Underneath the hero image is a white modal with a rounded primary CTA button labeled \"Let's go\"."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nFull-screen layout featuring a hero image of a coastal property. A prominent title and body text overlay the top portion of the image. Below the image, a full-width primary CTA button with rounded corners is present, containing call-to-action text."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, dark teal and white color palette with a nature-inspired accent.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image of a coastal landscape. A prominent title text is centered at the top, followed by supporting body text. Below the text, there are two stacked primary CTA buttons with rounded corners. Each button contains a text label. The background image extends to the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel theme, with a cool, desaturated color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image, overlaid with a welcome screen. A prominent title text block is at the top, followed by smaller body text. A rounded primary CTA button with white text is centered on the screen. Smaller text is placed above the button, acting as a subtitle or supporting text."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, dark color palette with an accent primary color.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen layout with a prominent title text at the top, followed by a subtitle. A primary CTA button is centrally located below the title and subtitle. At the bottom of the screen, there is a secondary button. The text on the buttons is clearly visible."}]}
{"sample_id": "2100_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with ample whitespace.\n\nThe screen features a full-width hero image at the top with a semi-transparent overlay and a title text. Below the hero, there is a section with a title and a search icon on the right. A horizontal scrollable list of product images follows. Below the images are category titles with corresponding body text. A list view is present with placeholder text. A bottom navigation bar with icons and labels is at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light gray and white color palette, with a focus on product presentation.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow, a search bar placeholder, and a notification icon. Below is a title \"Bedroom Furniture\". A grid layout displays product cards, each containing a lifestyle image of a bed, a product title, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar with icons for home, categories, search, saved items, and profile is present."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with a focus on white and light grays.\n\nThe layout features a full-width hero image at the top with a search bar overlay and menu/profile icons. Below the hero, a horizontal scrollable list of product category cards is displayed. A prominent title precedes a card component with product details, including a title, price, and a secondary category. Further down, another card includes a title, star ratings, a subtitle, and a chevron icon. A bottom navigation bar is present."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with white background.\n\nThe layout features a search bar at the top, followed by a prominent hero image showcasing bedroom furniture. Below the hero, a section displays \"Bedroom Furmitture\" and \"Beds\" as titles. A grid of furniture items is presented, each with a product image, a title, and a price tag. Search and cart icons are in the top right corner."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\nThe screen features a search bar at the top with a menu icon and a refresh icon. Below is a hero image and a prominent title. A list view displays furniture items, each with a product image, title, subtitle, and a small icon button on the right. A bottom navigation bar is present with three icons."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, muted gray and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a search input field and icon. Below, a list view displays categories like \"Bedroom Furniture\" and \"Dresses.\" A \"Shop\" section follows, with a breadcrumb navigation indicating \"Home > [Category Name].\" Several filter icons are horizontally arranged with associated numerical values and currency symbols. Two card components display product images of beds, titles, and numerical price tags. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with a focus on whitespace.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and a search field placeholder. Below, a large hero image showcases furniture, overlaid with a prominent title. A \"Bedroom Furniture\" heading introduces a grid-like list view of furniture items. Each item displays a product image, a title, and a numerical price tag, with some items featuring a sale badge. A bottom navigation bar provides access to different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, neutral color palette with gray accents.\n\nThe screen displays a product listing page with a top app bar containing a menu icon and search bar with the placeholder text \"Find anything furniture...\". Below the search bar is a category selector. The main content area presents a grid of product cards, each featuring a product image and a title. A bottom navigation bar provides access to different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, light gray and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a product listing in a grid layout. At the top is a hamburger menu icon and a prominent title. Below, the main content area features product cards with rounded corners. Each card contains a furniture image, a product title, a short description, and a numerical price tag. A standard bottom navigation bar is present."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, neutral color palette with light gray backgrounds and dark text.\n\nApp bar at the top with a prominent title and a search icon on the right. Below, a list view presents furniture categories, with a selected state indicated by a different background color. Each row contains a category name on the left and a corresponding title on the right. Some rows include small representative images of furniture. A bottom navigation bar features several icons with labels below each."}]}
{"sample_id": "iphone_IMG_906161_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, orange and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and user icon. Below is a back button and a search bar placeholder. A hero image depicting a landscape with people is present, overlaid with an \"Explore\" button. A title and subtitle are positioned above a horizontal scrollable list of image cards. A bottom navigation bar with icons is visible."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel/Discovery theme, warm peach and muted gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu, title \"Trending Now,\" and action icons. Below is a secondary navigation element. A large hero image card with rounded corners displays a cityscape with overlaid title and subtitle text, and a location pin icon. Below the hero, a horizontal scrollable list of smaller image cards with titles and descriptions. A bottom navigation bar with icon buttons is present."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel themed, Warm color palette with orange accents...\n\nThe screen features a search bar at the top with rounded corners and a \"Trending Now\" label. Below is a hero image with a large title. Two card components are arranged horizontally, labeled \"Ztokings\" and \"Bookings,\" each containing a smaller image and descriptive text elements below. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, orange and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a \"Trending Now\" title at the top, followed by a hero image of a cityscape with a text overlay. Below, there's a section titled \"Sxlook Preferred\" with a larger title and a circular notification badge on the right. Several text labels are arranged horizontally, followed by another row of text labels with associated values. A horizontal scrollable list of images sits above a bottom navigation bar with five icon buttons."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel/Exploration theme, warm orange and muted gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title and two text buttons for \"Search Now\" and \"Categories.\" Below, a hero image displays a cityscape with an overlayed title and subtitle, along with a location pin and descriptive text. A rectangular button with rounded corners is placed below the hero image. The \"Bookings\" section presents a horizontal scrollable list of card components, each containing a landscape image. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel App theme, neutral color palette with white cards on a blurred background.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a logo and \"Cart\" button. Below is a search bar with the prompt \"Search by destination or activity\". The main content area displays a list of card components, each featuring a landscape hero image, a prominent title, and descriptive text below. A bottom navigation bar contains several icons for different sections of the app. The blurred background image adds depth."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light color palette with subtle drop shadows.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and a settings icon. Below, a large card with rounded corners acts as a hero section, containing a landscape image, a prominent title, and a location pin icon. Underneath, two smaller cards display landscape images with titles and a dropdown icon. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons for different sections. Small text labels appear below the card images, likely for descriptions or metadata. A numerical value is placed to the right of the bottom navigation."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a muted gray and orange color palette. The screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and user profile icon. Below is a title \"Trending Now\" and a subtitle. A card component with rounded corners displays a hero image, a title, a subtitle, and a logo. Below this, a horizontal list view displays two smaller card components with landscape images and titles. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for home, profile, saved items, favorites, and search."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, warm theme, orange and black color palette, with a modern and playful aesthetic.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title. A large card component with rounded corners contains a hero image, a plus icon button, and descriptive text. Below the card, there is a horizontal scrollable list of image cards. A bottom navigation bar with five icons provides primary navigation. The overall layout uses consistent padding and whitespace."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, orange and dark gray color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a title \"Trending Now\" and an icon button. Below is a horizontal scrollable category selector with text labels. A hero image of a snowy mountain landscape is displayed. A card component with a title and subtitle is present. A list view with icon and text labels is shown. A bottom navigation bar with icons is at the bottom."}]}
{"sample_id": "iphone_IMG_3932_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, friendly theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a full-screen layout with a decorative illustration of a house and landscape at the top. Below this is a prominent title and body text. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels. The icons are for \"Feed,\" \"Saves,\" \"Alerts,\" \"Search,\" and \"Search.\""}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a logo at the top, followed by a hero section with cartoon-style houses and trees. A prominent title and a call-to-action button labeled \"Start Your Search\" are centrally aligned. Below, there's a subheading and body text. The bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels: \"Feed,\" \"Search,\" \"Saves,\" \"Alerts,\" and \"More.\""}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and a logo. Below, a large illustration of a house and trees serves as a hero image. A prominent title and body text are placed below the illustration. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a hero section with a cartoon-style illustration of a house and trees. Below, there's a prominent title and a subtitle. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is centrally aligned. The bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels below each, evenly spaced. The background is a clean white."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top section with a logo and a stylized illustration of a house and trees. Below this is a prominent title and a primary CTA button with rounded corners. The bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels. The background uses a wavy shape to separate the top and bottom sections."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, friendly and inviting theme, pastel purple and teal color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a logo and search icon. Below is a large illustrative hero image of a house and trees. A prominent title and body text are centered below the image. A primary CTA button spans the width of the screen, with a smaller secondary button to its right. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is at the very bottom."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a full-width illustrative header with a house graphic and a primary CTA button. Below is a prominent title and body text. A second illustration is present above a bottom navigation bar with five icon buttons. The header contains the app title."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette with a light, airy feel.\n\nThe screen features a top section with a logo and a stylized illustration of a house with trees. Below this is a section with a prominent title and supporting body text. Further down, there are two lines of placeholder text. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present, using a solid fill."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a hero image with cartoon houses and trees. Below the image is a prominent title and a primary CTA button with rounded corners. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present at the bottom of the screen. The background consists of abstract shapes in light blue and purple."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a central illustration of a house with trees. Above the illustration is a title text element. Below the illustration is a prominent title and