{"sample_id": "33575_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, with a primary color palette of blue and yellow.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and menu icon. Below is a prominent title \"Acapulco\" with a small icon. A search input field is present. Below the search bar are fields for \"Tuayeling for\" with options for adults, children, and date selection. A primary CTA button with the text \"Let's go!\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, blue and yellow color palette. The screen displays a travel booking form with a hero image at the bottom.\n\nThe layout includes a title, \"Acapulco,\" at the top left. Below are labels for \"Traveling for\" and \"Check-in,\" with corresponding date and number inputs using dropdown selectors. Below the inputs are labels for \"Primary CABurts\", \"Recetray/Soxlure\", and \"Tue\". A \"Let's go!\" label is above a primary CTA button with the text \"Ctaxilo!\". The bottom portion features a hero image with palm trees."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and playful theme, blue and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a back button and title at the top. Below is a rounded text input field with placeholder text and an icon. Another text input field follows, labeled with descriptive text. A segmented control allows selection between \"Business\" and \"Checkren,\" with numerical values displayed next to each. A date input field is present, followed by a prominent, rounded primary CTA button at the bottom."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a blue and white color palette, and a bright, airy feel.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image of a beach. A prominent title is at the top. Below, there's a search input field with a date placeholder and a search icon. Further down are input fields for travel details, including number of rooms, check-in date, and number of adults and children. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is centrally placed. At the bottom, a card component displays a numerical price tag."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, blue and white color palette with yellow accents.\n\nThe screen features a title bar with the text \"Acapulco\" and a menu icon. Below, there's a section with \"Tavel Air Rom\" and \"Travelry, 0 2022\". The main content area contains several rounded rectangle containers. The first contains a placeholder image and the number \"1\". Subsequent containers display the text \"Check Usituce\", \"01!\", and \"February 03 1221\", each with a circular icon on the right. A prominent primary CTA button with rounded corners and the text \"Let's go!\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, with a primary blue and accent yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a form-like layout with input fields for \"Room,\" \"Check-in,\" and \"Children.\" Below are two buttons labeled \"Check in!\" and \"Check out\" with numerical values. A date selection element is present, followed by a primary CTA button at the bottom labeled \"Let's go!\". The title \"Acacpulco\" is at the top."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a blue and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a back button in the top left, followed by a title bar. Below, a prominent title and subtitle. Two input fields are stacked vertically, each containing a numerical indicator and descriptive text. A large, stylized button spans the width of the screen with prominent text. At the bottom, a decorative graphic element and placeholder text."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, blue and yellow color palette. The screen features a title at the top, followed by a search bar and descriptive text. Below, there are input fields for \"Check in\" and \"Children!\", and a prominent yellow primary CTA button. Further down, there are two labels with numbers and a logo. The background shows a faint image."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, primary blue and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a booking interface with a title bar containing the app name and icons. Below, a back button with the label \"booking Room.\" Input fields for \"Travelin for\" and \"Februuary 07\" are present, followed by selection boxes for \"Adults\" and numerical values. A prominent \"Check go!\" button is centrally located. Further down, there are sections with a circular icon, the abbreviation for Tuesday, and a number. The screen concludes with a \"Let's s out!\" button."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, primary blue and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title at the top and a small icon on the right. Below is a text field with the label \"Check-out:\". The screen has a list of options with numbers and labels. There is a text block with gibberish text. Two primary CTA buttons are at the bottom of the screen."}]}
{"sample_id": "3458_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, purple and white color palette. The screen displays a list view of chart items. At the top is a title bar with a title and a menu icon. Below the title bar is a back button and a subtitle. Each list item consists of a circular icon on the left and a title and subtitle on the right. The circular icons contain placeholder images. The titles and subtitles are text elements."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, light color palette with purple accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of chart items. Each item consists of a square thumbnail image on the left and two lines of text on the right. The first line of text is a title, and the second line is a subtitle. A back button is in the top left corner, and a circle icon is in the top right corner. The title \"Charts\" is centered at the top of the screen. Each list item is separated by whitespace."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple and white color palette, with a modern, clean aesthetic.\n\nThe screen displays a list view within a card component, featuring rounded corners and subtle elevation. Each list item contains a square thumbnail image on the left, followed by a title and subtitle. Numerical values are aligned to the right of each item. The top navigation bar displays the title \"Charts\" and a small icon on the right. A secondary \"Charts\" title is placed below the navigation bar."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, light color palette with a purple accent color.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of chart items. Each item features a circular avatar image on the left, followed by a title, and subtitle text on the right. A back button and title are in the top navigation bar. A hamburger menu icon is on the top left. Each list item is separated by a subtle divider line."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list view with a top app bar containing a menu icon and the title \"Charts\". Each list item features a small image thumbnail on the left and text content on the right. The text content includes a title and additional descriptive text below it. The list items are separated by subtle dividers. A bottom navigation bar is present, with one item highlighted."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern theme, purple color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a list view of chart items. At the top, there's an app bar with a title \"Charts\" and a back button. Below the app bar, a segmented control with \"Tlve\" and \"Charts\" options. The main content is a list of cards, each containing a small thumbnail image, a title, and some subtitle text. Each card also has a chevron icon on the right, indicating navigation. The list is preceded by the title \"Top Antrit in To al\"."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern style, purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a \"Charts\" page with a back button in the top left. Below the title is a rounded-corner card with three list items, each containing a title and subtitle. Below the card is a list view of music tracks, each with a thumbnail image on the left and a title and subtitle on the right. The title is larger and bolder than the subtitle."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a purple and gray color palette, and a modern, minimalist aesthetic.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of chart items. Each item features a square image placeholder on the left and text content on the right. The text content includes a prominent title and a smaller subtitle below. A top app bar contains a back button on the left and the title \"Charts\" centered. A segmented control appears below the app bar. The list items extend vertically, using consistent spacing and padding."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, light color palette with purple accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of chart items. Each item contains a square thumbnail image on the left, followed by a title and subtitle stacked vertically. To the right of the text, there's a numerical value, presumably a price or ranking. The first item has a purple background behind the thumbnail. A top app bar displays a menu icon on the left and the title \"Charts\" centered."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple color palette...\n\nApp interface displaying a list of charts. The layout features a top navigation bar with a back arrow, title \"Charts,\" and a menu icon. Below is a list view with card-like items, each containing a square thumbnail image on the left and two lines of text on the right, presumably a title and subtitle. The list extends vertically, showing multiple entries with varying thumbnail images."}]}
{"sample_id": "1904_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, red and black color palette, with a modern, music-focused aesthetic.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a search field and music note icon. Below, a title precedes a horizontally scrolling card list with album art and artist information. A red \"DESCOVOER\" banner separates the card list from a vertical list of songs with titles and icons. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels. The general purpose of the text is to display song titles, artist names, and navigation labels."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern music app, clean white and red color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and search input field. Below, a title introduces a horizontally scrolling list of album art cards. Another title introduces a second row of album art cards. A red play button with the word \"SHOVIVE\" is present. A third title introduces a third row of album art cards. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels. The central icon is a prominent red circle."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a red accent color.\n\nApp screen featuring a top app bar with a back button, search field, and page title. Below is a hero section with a carousel of \"Exclusive Interview\" content, featuring a placeholder image and a \"See More\" CTA. A section titled \"Pouya\" introduces a horizontal scrolling list of music album cards with album art, song titles, and numerical data. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, red and black color palette. The layout features a top navigation bar with a search input field and action icons. Below, a hero section showcases trending music with a rounded card, artist avatars, and prominent title text. A \"Trending Singles\" section displays a horizontal scrollable list of album art cards with song titles and artist names. Similarly, an \"In Masmeata\" section presents another horizontal list of album art cards. A bottom navigation bar is present for primary app functions."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant music app, red and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a search bar at the top, followed by sections for \"Trend Singles,\" \"Interviews,\" and \"Stories.\" Each section displays a horizontal list of album art cards with song titles and artist names below. A red FAB is anchored to the bottom right. The bottom navigation bar contains standard navigation icons."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray and accent primary color scheme.\n\nThe layout features a search bar at the top with a search icon and options, followed by a \"Trending Singles\" section with a horizontal scrollable list of album art cards. Below is an \"Exclusive Interview\" section with larger card components displaying artist images and titles. A heart icon is placed next to the section title. Text labels appear below each card. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern music app, red and white color palette. The screen features a top app bar with a back button and a search bar. Below is a large hero image with rounded corners, displaying an artist. Text overlays the image, indicating song and artist names. A \"Trending Singles\" section follows, with a horizontal scrollable list of album art cards. Each card includes an image, title, and artist name. A \"See More\" link is positioned to the right of the section title. At the bottom is a bottom navigation bar with five icons."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern and clean, light color palette with black bottom navigation.\n\nThe screen features a hero section with a blurred background image and a prominent title. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of card components displaying album art. Each card includes a title, artist name, and a smaller text label. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for different sections of the app. A \"PORA\" button is placed in the top right corner. The section is titled \"Trending Singles\"."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern aesthetic, monochromatic with a red accent color...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and a search bar with placeholder text. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of card components displaying music album art and artist names. A \"Discover\" title precedes a grid layout of similar music album cards. The bottom navigation bar contains five icons for primary app functions. Each card contains a placeholder image and associated artist and song title text."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, red and gray color palette, with a modern, minimalist aesthetic.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a search input field and an icon button. Below is a horizontal scrollable list of album art images with a label \"Exclusive Singles.\" A vertical list view displays \"Exclusive Interview\" content, each item with album art and song title. A bottom navigation bar provides \"Music,\" \"Eng,\" and \"Nelivy\" options. The list items include action icons on the right."}]}
{"sample_id": "26309_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light gray and white color palette. The layout features a top app bar with a title and search icons. Below is a category tag. The main content area displays a \"Free Magazine\" title followed by a horizontal list of card components. Each card contains a square image placeholder, a title, and a subtitle. The images show a burger and a lake."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist style, muted beige and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title. Below, a section labeled \"Free books\" displays a horizontal list of card components, each containing a placeholder image, title, subtitle, and price information. A section labeled \"Placecrumbs\" follows, with similar card layouts. A circular element displays a price. The bottom navigation bar contains several icons for different sections."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist theme, muted gray and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a menu icon on the left and a search icon on the right. Below the app bar is a title. The main content area consists of a vertical list of card components. Each card displays a title and a numerical price tag."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist theme, light beige and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a hamburger menu, search icon, language selection, and user profile icons. Below, a horizontal navigation bar displays \"Free books,\" \"Free,\" and \"Magazine.\" The main content area presents a card-based layout, each card containing a landscape image, title text, a toggle, a subtitle, and a numerical value. The cards are arranged in a horizontal scrolling list."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, muted beige color palette. The screen displays a list view of book items.\n\nEach item features a book cover image on the left, followed by a title, a numerical identifier, and a category label. A price tag is aligned to the right edge of each item. A hamburger menu icon and a settings icon are positioned in the top corners of the screen. The list items are separated by subtle dividers."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist theme, light gray and white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and user profile icon. Below, a prominent title \"English\" is displayed. A segmented control with \"Free books\" and \"Magazine\" options is present. The main content area displays a grid of card components, each containing a placeholder image, a title, descriptive text, and a numerical price tag. Star rating elements are also included. The cards are arranged in a two-column layout."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette...\n\nApp screen displaying a list of items. The top app bar contains a back arrow, language selector, and a \"Free\" label on the left, and a location icon on the right. Below the app bar is a horizontally scrolling list of card components, each containing a hero image and a title. Below this is a grid layout of card components, each with a product image, title text, a price, and a discounted price."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, neutral color palette with a light background and muted brown accents.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with a title and a circular profile icon. Below, there's a section with a 'Free' label and a title. The main content area displays two card components arranged horizontally. Each card contains a landscape image, a title, a numerical price tag, and additional descriptive text below. The cards have rounded corners and subtle drop shadows for elevation."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and minimalist theme, with a light beige and off-white color palette.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and a profile icon. Below, there are two card components arranged horizontally, each containing an image and text. The left card has a dark background with a burger image, while the right card has a white background with a title, price, and a \"Free\" button. A \"Magazine\" title is followed by a horizontal filter bar with icons. Below, there is another section titled \"Aagazine\" with similar card components; the left card displays an image, and the right card displays a title, price, and a button with \"120f\" text."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, minimalist style, neutral beige color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title bar with \"English Free\" and a back button. The main content area contains four rounded-corner cards arranged in a 2x2 grid. Each card has a title; two cards display text labels like \"Free books\" and \"Magazine\" with a small icon, while the other two display numerical values like \"5646\" and \"150\". The background is a solid beige color."}]}
{"sample_id": "34216_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, with a teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top section with text describing location and guest count, plus filter and menu icons. Below, a horizontal scrollable list of card components displaying travel destinations with placeholder images. Each card includes a title, subtitle, and descriptive text. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for different sections of the app. A price tag is displayed in the top right corner. A title is placed above the horizontal scrollable list."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, light color palette with green accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a logo and a message icon. Below, a tab bar with \"HOMES\" and \"EXPERIENCE\" labels. A grid layout displays travel destination cards, each with a rounded image placeholder, a title, and a short description. Each card also includes a small icon. A bottom navigation bar with four icons is present. Text elements include titles, descriptions, and price tags."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button, a \"For You\" label, and a hamburger menu icon. Below is a search bar with placeholder text. A title \"EXPLERIES\" introduces a horizontally scrolling list of card components. Each card contains a travel-themed image, a title, a price, and a dismiss icon. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title text. Below is a search input field with a placeholder text. A segmented control is present for filtering options. The main content area displays a grid list of card components, each containing a lifestyle image, title text, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar with icons is visible at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Travel theme, Light pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen displays a grid-based layout of destination cards. Each card contains a landscape image at the top, followed by a title, and a call-to-action button. The top navigation bar includes a title and menu icon. A bottom navigation bar is present with three icons and labels. A floating action button is positioned in the bottom right corner. Each card also includes descriptive text and a price."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, dark teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and a title. Below is a search bar with rounded corners and a dropdown button. A grid of four card components displays travel destinations with landscape images. Each card has a title and subtitle indicating the number of trips or guests. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons for different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title text. Below, a grid layout displays travel destination cards with rounded corners and lifestyle imagery. Each card includes a title, a secondary text description, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar contains three buttons: two circular ghost buttons and a primary teal-colored FAB."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Teal theme, with a light color palette and clean design.\n\nThe layout features a top search bar with the text \"Anywhere, guest\". Below is a segmented control with options like \"FOR YOU,\" \"ANYTIME,\" \"EXPERIENCE,\" and \"PLAACES.\" A list view displays card components with landscape images. Each card includes a title, a short description, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar contains icons for different sections."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, light color palette with subtle shadows.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu icon and text labels. Below is a title and a grid-like list view of card components, each displaying a scenic image. Each card includes a title, a short description, and a numerical price tag. A bottom navigation bar with standard icons is present."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, cool teal and white color palette with a clean, modern aesthetic.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a search icon and a title. Below is a section with the title \"FOR YOU\" and a username. A grid of cards displays travel destinations with placeholder images, titles, and prices. A bottom navigation bar contains icons and labels for \"INDLREX\" and \"EXLORE\". A floating action button (FAB) is positioned on the bottom right."}]}
{"sample_id": "10249_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern aesthetic, light and dark color palette with pink accent.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a search icon and a notification icon. Below is a title, followed by a section labeled \"in Collections\" displaying a horizontal scrollable list of image cards with rounded corners. Each card has a placeholder image and a text label underneath. A pink-colored segmented control is present. Below the segmented control are two rounded button elements. The bottom navigation bar contains icons for different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern aesthetic, light color palette with subtle orange accents.\n\nThe screen displays a grid-based layout of image cards. Each card contains a square image placeholder above a title and supporting text. Some cards include a \"Follow\" button. A prominent title \"Collections\" is at the top with a back arrow. Below the title is a smaller title \"in Collection Ball\". A bottom navigation bar with icons is present at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray and white color palette.\n\nApp interface displaying a \"Collections\" screen with a top navigation bar containing a back button and profile icon. Below the title, two landscape image cards are horizontally aligned. Below that, a grid layout of card components with titles and descriptions. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present, along with a central floating action button (FAB)."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, warm orange and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and the title \"Collections.\" Below, a grid layout displays image cards with rounded corners. Each card contains a landscape image and a title. A section labeled \"Home\" and \"Communities\" is followed by another grid of image cards, each including a landscape image, title, and numerical data. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and title. Below is a search bar with a search icon. A grid layout displays image cards with titles and subtitles. Each card contains a landscape image placeholder. Below each image is a title and a rating section. A bottom navigation bar contains several icons for navigation. A \"Follow\" button is positioned on the right side of the top app bar."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, with a muted gray color palette and subtle use of whitespace.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a hamburger menu and user profile. Below is a segmented control with \"Featured\" and \"Collections\" tabs. A grid of four image cards displays placeholder images with titles below each. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons with labels: \"Home,\" \"Pipht,\" \"Finte,\" and \"Srolah.\""}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, modern minimalist theme, light mode with a neutral color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and \"Featured\" title. Below, a large card with rounded corners displays a hero image and a title text overlay. A grid layout follows, presenting four smaller cards with images, titles, and subtitles. Each card also includes a small icon. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons and a numerical indicator on the right."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark mode theme, muted gray and orange accents...\n\nApp features a top app bar with a logo and action icons. Below is a horizontal scrolling chip component. A search bar with placeholder text sits above a grid layout of card components with landscape images. Each card has a title and subtitle text. Section headers are placed above each row of cards. A standard bottom navigation bar is present."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean aesthetic, light color palette with subtle gray accents.\n\nThe screen displays a grid layout of image cards, each representing a collection. Each card contains a square image placeholder, a title, and supporting text below. A top app bar contains a profile icon, a title \"Featured Collections,\" and action icons. A bottom navigation bar is present with icons for home, search, and profile."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dark theme, muted gray color palette with subtle gradients.\n\nThe screen features a \"Featured\" title at the top left and a search icon on the top right. Below is a search bar with an icon, the text \"Collections in Crystal Balll\", and \"+\" icon. A grid layout displays image cards with landscape photography. Each card has a title below the image and an icon on the right. A bottom navigation bar contains three icons for navigation."}]}
{"sample_id": "Android_Android_51_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dreamy aesthetic, pastel pink and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image. The Agoda logo is placed at the top left. Below the logo is a block of text describing terms of use and privacy policy. At the bottom of the screen is a primary CTA button with rounded corners."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding screen, pastel color palette with pink and purple gradients.\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left, followed by a block of body text describing terms of use and privacy policy. Below that is a smaller line of text. At the bottom of the screen is a full-width primary CTA button with rounded corners and the text \"Got it\". The background is a gradient of pink and purple. At the top of the screen are colorful circles."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dreamy theme, pastel pink and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left. Below the logo is a block of body text. At the bottom of the screen is a primary CTA button with rounded corners and a gradient fill. The background is a gradient image."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding screen, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image with a gradient from light blue to pink. The Agoda logo is placed at the top left. Below the logo is a block of body text describing the terms of service. At the bottom of the screen is a primary CTA button with rounded corners."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Dreamy/Pastel theme, Pink and Blue color palette...\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left, followed by a block of illegible text describing terms of use and privacy policy. Below this is a large empty space with a background image of mountains. At the bottom, there's a text label and a primary CTA button with rounded corners, both containing the text \"Got it\"."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, whimsical theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image of pink and white clouds. The Agoda logo is at the top left. Below the logo is a block of body text describing the terms of service. A rounded primary CTA button with the text \"Got it\" is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, dreamy theme, pastel pink and blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left, followed by a block of body text describing the app's terms and privacy policy. A large, rounded primary CTA button with white text is anchored at the bottom of the screen. The background is a gradient of pink and blue, resembling a sky with clouds."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, pastel color palette with pink and purple gradients.\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left, followed by a legal disclaimer text block. Above the logo are overlapping circles with varying opacities. The background is a soft gradient image. At the bottom, there is a primary CTA button with rounded corners and white text."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, Soft Gradient theme, Pastel Pink and Blue color palette.\n\nThe screen features the Agoda logo at the top left, followed by a block of body text describing terms of use and privacy policy. The background is a gradient image of mountains. At the bottom is a primary CTA button with rounded corners."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel pink and blue color palette. The screen features a full-screen background image of a mountain range at sunset.\n\nAt the top is the \"agoda\" logo and a decorative pattern of colorful circles. Below the logo is a block of body text describing the app's terms and privacy policy. At the bottom of the screen is a primary CTA button with rounded corners and white text."}]}
{"sample_id": "Android_Android_4_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, pastel color palette...\n\nApp interface displaying a product grid layout with four product cards. Each card contains a product image, a title, and pricing information. Above the grid is a horizontal navigation bar with text labels. Below the grid is a promotional banner with large text. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean e-commerce theme, light color palette with purple accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back button and text labels for navigation. Below, a horizontally scrolling list of product cards, each displaying a product image, a \"Home\" label, a product title, a heart icon, and price information with strikethrough. A full-width purple button is placed below the product cards. Another grid layout of product cards follows, with similar product information. A bottom navigation bar with icons for different sections is present."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and a notification icon. Below, a hero image showcases people with an umbrella. A prominent title introduces the section. A carousel indicator sits above a horizontal list view of product cards, each displaying a product image and a title. A bottom navigation bar with five icons provides main navigation."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, e-commerce theme, light color palette with purple accents.\n\nThe layout features a top app bar with a logo and cart icon. Below are two horizontal scrolling image cards with product images, titles, and prices. A grid of product cards follows, each with a product image, brand logo, product description, and price. Below the product cards are two primary CTAs and one secondary button. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, vibrant purple and teal color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top navigation bar with menu icon and text labels. Below, a grid layout displays product cards, each containing a product image, a title, and a \"Cart\" label with a radio button. At the bottom, a curved teal and purple section contains a text label and a price range. A bottom navigation bar with several icon buttons is present."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list view of card components with rounded corners and subtle drop shadows. Each card contains a split-screen image layout, showcasing product photography. Below each image, there's a prominent title and smaller descriptive text. A top app bar displays a back button, title text, and a user icon. A bottom navigation bar contains five icons for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, playful theme, pastel color palette...\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a back arrow and title. Below is a hero image showcasing a lifestyle product. A prominent title is overlaid on the image. The main content area displays a grid of product cards, each with a product image, title, price, and additional details. A bottom navigation bar with five icons provides access to different sections of the app."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, E-commerce themed, pastel purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a product listing page titled \"Offers\" at the top. Below the title, a grid layout presents product cards, each featuring a lifestyle image, a product title, a short description, and a numerical price tag. Each product card has a rounded corner and a subtle drop shadow. The bottom navigation bar contains five icon buttons for primary navigation."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, e-commerce theme, cool color palette with blues and purples, and a clean, modern aesthetic.\n\nThe screen displays a product listing in a grid layout, with four product cards visible. Each card contains a product image, a title, a short description, and a price. A rounded primary CTA button is placed centrally below the product grid. A bottom navigation bar with five icons is present. The top app bar contains a back arrow on the left and a circular icon on the right, with a title in the center."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, E-commerce theme, light purple and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with promotional text. Below is a \"Home\" title followed by a grid layout of product cards. Each card contains a product image, title text, price, and star ratings. A bottom navigation bar with icons for Home, Favorites, Search, and Account is present. The product images show various winter clothing items."}]}
{"sample_id": "21727_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, bright color palette. The screen features a circular graphic at the top with a palm tree illustration.\n\nBelow is a welcome title, followed by a rounded primary CTA button. A secondary \"Continue\" button is placed further down, separated by a divider. At the bottom is a close button."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, with a green and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a circular logo at the top with a palm tree icon. Below the logo is a welcome message and a secondary text element. A prominent yellow 'Continue' button is centrally located. The bottom section displays a background image of palm trees. A bottom navigation bar is present with a green circular close button on the right."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel app onboarding, bright color palette of green, yellow, and white.\n\nThe screen features a back arrow icon and close icon in the top corners. A circular logo containing a palm tree graphic is centered below the top section. A rounded primary CTA button with an arrow icon is placed below the logo. A prominent title and supporting body text are stacked below the button. A final text element is at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding theme, bright and cheerful color palette of yellow, green, and white.\n\nThe screen features a large circular graphic at the top containing a palm tree icon. Below, a prominent title and supporting body text introduce the app. A primary CTA button labeled \"CONTINUE\" is centered below the text. Page indicator dots are placed below the button. At the bottom, three circular buttons are arranged horizontally, likely for navigation or actions. The left and right buttons are filled with green and contain icons, while the center button is an outlined circle."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, tropical theme, green and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background with a circular graphic containing a palm tree at the top. Below the graphic is a prominent title. A rounded-corner primary CTA button is centered below the title. Pagination dots are placed below the button. A circular close button is located at the bottom right corner."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel theme, muted green and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background image. At the top, a circular logo with a palm tree icon. Below the logo, a prominent title and a highlighted call to action. Body text is placed below the title. A primary CTA button is positioned above the background image. At the bottom, a bottom navigation bar with a single icon."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, bright color palette. The screen features a clean layout with ample whitespace.\n\nA rounded-corner card at the top contains a circular logo with a palm tree. An \"X\" icon is placed in the upper right corner, and an arrow icon is placed in the upper left corner. Below the card is a prominent title, followed by a subtitle and a paragraph of body text. A primary CTA button with rounded corners is centrally aligned. A bottom navigation bar contains several icons for navigation."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, muted gray color palette with a bright accent color.\n\nThe screen features a circular logo at the top containing a palm tree graphic. Below this is a prominent title and a primary CTA button. Body text is placed below the button. At the bottom, there is a horizontal navigation bar with three buttons: back, close, and forward. The close button is centered and has a circular background."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant and playful theme, with a bright green and yellow color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-screen background with a stylized mountain range at the bottom. A large circular logo containing a palm tree icon is centered at the top. Below the logo is a prominent title, followed by a block of body text. A rounded rectangle primary CTA button with the text \"CONTINUE\" is positioned in the lower half of the screen. A small close icon is in the top left corner and a navigation icon in the top right. A page indicator is at the bottom center."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, onboarding flow, muted gray color palette with accent colors.\n\nThe screen features a circular logo container at the top, containing a stylized palm tree graphic. Below, a prominent title welcomes the user. A progress indicator bar is centered below the title. A primary CTA button with all-caps text is placed centrally. A horizontal row of circular indicators shows the current step in the onboarding process. A close button is in the top right corner."}]}
{"sample_id": "25255_output", "captions": [{"seed": 2001, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a full-width hero image at the top. Below, a horizontal navigation bar with text labels. A horizontally scrolling card component displays various logos and promotional images with teal backgrounds and overlaid text. Below this, a list view displays text labels and icons. A teal-colored FAB is anchored to the bottom right corner. \"More\" buttons are present to indicate expandable sections."}, {"seed": 9999, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, bright and airy theme, light teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays \"Offers\" at the top. Below is a hero image with a cityscape. A promotional banner with a cashback offer sits below the image. The next section contains a title, subtitle, and descriptive text, along with a circular icon on the right. A primary CTA button is centered below. A list of text links follows. Finally, a horizontal scrollable card component displays two cards with images, titles, and descriptions. A circular icon is placed on the bottom right."}, {"seed": 42, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, vibrant theme, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen displays a list of offers, starting with a hero image at the top. Below the hero image is a segmented control with three options. Underneath are offer cards with titles, descriptions, and numerical price tags. Each card has a secondary button and a primary CTA. An icon is placed at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 5555, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern style, teal and white color palette.\n\nThe screen features a hero image of a train at the top, followed by a horizontal tab bar with \"Offers,\" \"Neary Stores,\" and \"Restaurants.\" Below is a section titled \"UPPULAR $10 OFFERS\" with a \"More\" link. Three offer cards are displayed, each with an icon, title, and subtitle. Below this are three dropdown menus and a grid of cards with placeholder images. Finally, there are three rectangular buttons at the bottom."}, {"seed": 1994, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays a list of \"Offers.\" At the top, there is a hero image featuring a train. Below, there are card components, each containing a smaller image on the left and descriptive text on the right. Each card has a title, a short description, and a teal-colored button. At the bottom, there is a teal-colored bar and a circular FAB with a white icon."}, {"seed": 1234, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, muted gray and teal color palette.\n\nThe screen features a title bar with a back button and \"Offers\" title. Below, a section titled \"Reaturts\" with a \"More\" link. A horizontal scrollable list of card components displays train images, titles like \"Popular Offres,\" and prices. A teal banner promotes a cashback offer with body text and a circular icon. Below, another horizontal list of card components with city images, titles, and prices. A bottom navigation bar is present."}, {"seed": 777, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern theme, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen features a top app bar with a menu icon and the title \"Offers.\" Below is a hero image with overlaid text and a primary CTA button. The body contains a list view of card components, each with a placeholder image, title, descriptive text, and a price. There are also secondary text labels and a signature graphic. At the bottom are two buttons, one with a chevron icon and the other a primary CTA."}, {"seed": 1111, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, travel-themed, light color palette with teal accents. A hero image of a train over a cityscape sits atop the screen. Below, a title and a horizontal row of three rounded-corner buttons.\n\nA \"cashback\" section features two card components with images of buildings, titles, descriptions, and numerical price tags. A \"more\" link is placed to the right. Another row of two cards follows, with similar elements. A rounded floating action button (FAB) is in the lower right corner. A full-width button is at the bottom."}, {"seed": 8080, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays an \"Offers\" page with a hero image at the top, followed by a promotional banner with text overlay. Below, a section titled \"RESTURTS\" presents a horizontal list view of card components, each featuring a placeholder image, title, a cashback offer, and interactive elements like a heart icon and a circle icon. A similar section, \"RETANNTS\", follows the same card layout. A bottom bar with text is visible at the bottom of the screen."}, {"seed": 3333, "caption": "High-fidelity mobile UI, clean and modern, light color palette with teal accents.\n\nThe screen displays an \"Offers\" page with a prominent title. Below, two card components are arranged horizontally, each featuring a landscape image, a title, descriptive text, and a teal-colored CTA button. A rectangular card with a yellow icon and placeholder text is placed below the cards. \"Slunerlay by Croofaky\" text is present. A full-width teal button with text is at the bottom. A bottom navigation bar with icons is present."}]}
